    subtitle: "Har lafz ka asaan matlab, Pakistan ki asal misaal, aur paper wali baat",
    blocks: <LessonBlock>[
      LessonBlock.heading("Ye topic kyun zaroori hai"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Dekho, PPSC ke paper me bohat se sawal asal me mushkil nahi hote, bas lafz mushkil hota hai. Sawal poochta hai ke falan cheez delta hai ya plateau, doab kise kehte hain, barrage aur dam me kya farq hai. Student ko jagah yaad hoti hai lekin lafz ka matlab pakka nahi hota, aur wahi number kat jata hai. Is liye hum geography ki asal shuruaat yahan se karte hain. Pehle har lafz ka matlab itna asaan kar ke samjho ke tum apne lafzon me kisi ko samjha sako. Matlab pakka ho jaye to naqsha khud bolne lagta hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Har lafz ko teen hisso me parho ge. Pehle aik line me asaan matlab, jese ustad class me samjhata hai. Phir Pakistan ki aik asal misaal, taake lafz hawa me na rahe. Aur aakhir me wo baat jo paper me sawal banti hai. Bas yehi tartib zehen me bitha lo."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Doab"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Do daryaaon ke darmiyan phasi hui zameen ko doab kehte hain. Lafz hi apna matlab bata raha hai, do matlab do aur aab matlab pani yani darya. Do darya aur un ke darmiyan ki zameen, bas yehi doab hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pakistan ki misaal ye hai. Punjab me paanch mashhoor doab hain. Indus aur Jhelum ke darmiyan Sindh Sagar Doab hai aur Chenab aur Ravi ke darmiyan Rachna Doab hai, jahan Faisalabad aur Gujranwala jese sheher hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Har doab ka naam unhi do daryaaon ke naamon ke pehle harfon se bana hai. Chaj matlab Chenab aur Jhelum, Bari matlab Beas aur Ravi. Naam toro, darya khud samne ajayenge, aur sawal hal ho jayega."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Darra (Pass, Mountain Pass)"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Pahari silsile ke andar wo tang aur nicha rasta jahan se guzar kar dusri taraf jaya ja sake, use darra kehte hain. Pahar to har jagah uncha hota hai, lekin darra wo kamzor nuqta hai jahan pahar insaan ko rasta de deta hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pakistan ki misaal ye hai. Khyber Darra Pakistan ko Afghanistan se milata hai aur Peshawar se Kabul ka purana rasta yehi hai. Khunjerab Darra Pakistan ko China se milata hai aur duniya ki sab se unchi paved sarhad wali guzargah hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Sawal hamesha jora bana kar ata hai, konsa darra kin do ilaaqon ko milata hai. Khyber Afghanistan ke sath, Khunjerab China ke sath, Bolan Quetta ko Sibi aur Sindh ki taraf jane wale raste ke sath. Ye jore pakke kar lo."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Dam"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Dam darya ke raste me banayi gayi wo mazboot deewar hai jo pani ko peeche rok kar aik bara zakhira bana leti hai. Is zakhire se bijli bhi banti hai aur khushk mausam me faslon ko pani bhi milta hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pakistan ki misaal ye hai. Tarbela Dam darya-e-Indus par hai aur mitti se bana duniya ka sab se bara dam kaha jata hai. Mangla Dam darya-e-Jhelum par hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Dam hamesha apne darya ke sath yaad rakho. Tarbela Indus par, Mangla Jhelum par, Warsak Kabul par. Paper dam ka naam de kar darya poochta hai ya darya de kar dam."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Barrage"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Barrage bhi darya par bani deewar hoti hai lekin dam se chhoti aur us ka kaam mukhtalif hai. Barrage pani ka bara zakhira nahi banata, bas darya ki satah zara unchi karke pani ko nehron ki taraf mor deta hai, taake aabpashi ho sake."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pakistan ki misaal ye hai. Sukkur Barrage darya-e-Indus par 1932 me bana tha aur is ka purana naam Lloyd Barrage hai. Is se nikalne wali nehron se Sindh ki bohat bari zameen serab hoti hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Dam aur barrage ka farq paper ka pasandeeda sawal hai. Dam zakhira aur bijli ke liye, barrage pani nehron me morne ke liye. Aur Indus par aakhri barrage Kotri hai, use Ghulam Muhammad Barrage bhi kehte hain."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Delta"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Jahan darya samandar me girne se pehle sust ho jata hai, apne sath layi hui mitti aur ret wahan bicha deta hai aur kai chhoti shakho me bant kar samandar me milta hai, us pankhe jaisi zameen ko delta kehte hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pakistan ki misaal ye hai. Darya-e-Indus Thatta aur Keti Bandar ke qareeb Arabian Sea me girta hai aur wahan Indus Delta banta hai. Ye duniya ke bare delton me se aik hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Pakistan ka sirf aik hi mashhoor delta hai aur wo Indus ka hai. Sawal seedha ata hai ke Indus Delta kis ilaqay me hai, jawab Thatta ke aas paas ka sahil hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Plateau (Satah Murtafa)"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Wo unchi zameen jo pahar ki tarah nukili na ho, balke upar se hamvar aur chat jaisi ho, use plateau ya satah murtafa kehte hain. Asaan alfaaz me, unchi magar seedhi zameen."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pakistan ki misaal ye hai. Pothohar Plateau Indus aur Jhelum ke darmiyan hai, jahan Rawalpindi, Chakwal aur Jhelum ke ilaqay ate hain. Balochistan ka aksar hissa bhi aik uncha plateau hi hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Pothohar ko hamesha Salt Range aur soan ki tehzeeb ke sath jor kar poochha jata hai. Aur Balochistan raqbe me sab se bara soba hone ki aik wajah yehi wasee plateau hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Maidan (Plain)"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Wo neechi aur hamvar zameen jahan darya behte hain aur khetyan asaan hoti hain, use maidan kehte hain. Maidan daryaaon ki layi hui mitti se banta hai, is liye ye sab se zarkhez zameen hoti hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pakistan ki misaal ye hai. Punjab aur Sindh ka aksar hissa Indus aur us ke madadgar daryaaon ka banaya hua maidan hai. Isi liye Pakistan ki zyada tar abadi aur zyada tar faslein inhi maidanon me hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Sawal ata hai ke Pakistan ki zyada tar abadi maidanon me kyun hai. Jawab yehi mitti aur pani hai. Maidan suno to Indus, Punjab aur Sindh zehen me lao."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Registran (Desert)"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Wo ilaaqa jahan barish bohat kam ho, pani na mile aur ret ya khushk zameen door tak phaili ho, use registran kehte hain. Registran me din garam aur raat thandi hoti hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pakistan ki misaal ye hai. Sindh me Thar ka registran hai jahan Nagarparkar aur Umerkot hain. Punjab me Cholistan hai jahan Derawar Fort khara hai, aur Balochistan me Kharan ka registran hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Har registran ko us ke sobay aur aik pehchan wali jagah ke sath yaad rakho. Thar ke sath Sindh, Cholistan ke sath Bahawalpur aur Derawar Fort, Kharan ke sath Balochistan."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Glacier"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Paharon par jama hua barf ka wo wasee aur mota teh jo saalon me jamta hai aur bohat ahista ahista dhalan ki taraf sarkta hai, use glacier kehte hain. Glacier asal me barf ka darya hai, bas us ki raftaar bohat sust hoti hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pakistan ki misaal ye hai. Siachen Glacier Karakoram me hai aur qatbi ilaaqon ke bahar duniya ke sab se lambe glachieron me se hai. Baltoro Glacier se K2 ki taraf jaya jata hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Siachen ko duniya ka sab se uncha medaan-e-jang bhi kaha jata hai aur yehi line paper me ati hai. Glacier suno to Karakoram aur barf zehen me lao, maidan nahi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Madadgar Darya (Tributary)"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Wo chhota darya jo kisi bare darya me ja milta hai aur apna pani us ke hawale kar deta hai, use madadgar darya ya tributary kehte hain. Milne ke baad us ka apna naam khatam ho jata hai aur bara darya hi aage barhta hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pakistan ki misaal ye hai. Darya-e-Kabul Attock ke qareeb Indus me milta hai, yani Kabul Indus ka madadgar darya hai. Jhelum Trimmu ke maqam par Chenab me milta hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Paper jore ulta karke phansata hai. Ravi Indus me nahi milta, Chenab me milta hai. Swat seedha Indus me nahi milta, pehle Kabul me milta hai. Ye milne wale maqamat pakke kar lo."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Sarhad (Border)"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Do mulkon ke darmiyan wo tay shuda lakeer jo aik mulk ki zameen ko dusre se alag karti hai, use sarhad kehte hain. Sarhad zameen par bhi hoti hai aur naqshay par bhi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pakistan ki misaal ye hai. Pakistan ki sarhadein chaar mulkon se milti hain. Mashriq me India, maghrib me Afghanistan aur Iran, aur shumal me China."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Sab se lambi sarhad Afghanistan ke sath hai aur sab se chhoti China ke sath. Sarhadon ki lambai wala sawal har dusre paper me ata hai, is liye har sarhad ko us ke mulk aur us ki khaas lakeer ke sath yaad rakho."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Line of Control"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Line of Control, jisay mukhtasaran LoC kehte hain, Pakistan aur India ke darmiyan Kashmir me wo aarzi lakeer hai jahan dono mulkon ki faujein aamne saamne hain. Ye tay shuda sarhad nahi, jang bandi se bani hui lakeer hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pakistan ki misaal ye hai. Ye lakeer Azad Kashmir ko Bharat ke zir-e-intizam Kashmir se alag karti hai aur takhreeban 740 kilometre lambi hai. Neelum Valley is ke bilkul qareeb hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. LoC 1972 ke Shimla Muahide ke baad is naam se pehchani gayi. Paper me ye sarhad se alag ginni jati hai, is farq ko samajh lo ke LoC aarzi hai, sarhad tay shuda hoti hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Durand Line"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Durand Line Pakistan aur Afghanistan ke darmiyan wo sarhad hai jo 1893 me aik muahide se tay hui thi. Is ka naam us angrez afsar Sir Mortimer Durand ke naam par hai jis ne ye muahida karwaya tha."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pakistan ki misaal ye hai. Ye lakeer 2,430 kilometre lambi hai (kuch kitaabon me 2,640 bhi likha milta hai, lekin one paper ki mashhoor textbook rakam 2,430 hi hai) aur Khyber se Chaman tak ke ilaaqon ko Afghanistan se alag karti hai. Torkham aur Chaman is ki mashhoor guzargahen hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Teen baatein aik sath yaad rakho. Saal 1893, mulk Afghanistan, aur ye Pakistan ki sab se lambi sarhad hai. Ye teeno aik hi sawal ke mukhtalif roop hain."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Division"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Division sobay ki wo bari intizami ikai hai jo kai zilon ko mila kar banti hai. Soba sab se bara hota hai, us ke neeche division ata hai, aur division ke neeche zila. Division ka sarbarah Commissioner hota hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pakistan ki misaal ye hai. Punjab me Lahore Division hai jis ke neeche Lahore, Kasur, Sheikhupura aur Nankana Sahib ke zilay ate hain. Sindh me Karachi Division hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Har sobay ki divisions ki tadaad aur naam pooche jate hain. Punjab ki 10 divisions sab se zyada dohrayi jati hain, aur Gujrat Division nisbatan nayi hai, ye baat bhi note kar lo."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("District (Zila)"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Zila intizam ki wo ikai hai jahan se asal me awam ka roz ka kaam chalta hai. Har zilay ka sarbarah Deputy Commissioner hota hai, jisay aam zubaan me DC kehte hain. Zameen ke record, aman-o-aman aur sarkari kaam isi daftar se chalte hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pakistan ki misaal ye hai. Lahore aik zila hai, Multan aik zila hai, Quetta aik zila hai. Har sobay me darjanon zilay hain aur waqt ke sath naye zilay bante rehte hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Har sobay ke zilon ki tadaad Pakistan Studies ka sab se mashhoor sawal hai. Tadaad badal sakti hai kyunke naye zilay bante rehte hain, is liye hamesha taaza tadaad yaad rakho. Is ki mukammal tafseel provinces wali file me di gayi hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Tehsil"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Tehsil zilay ke andar ki chhoti intizami ikai hai. Aik zilay me kai tehsilein hoti hain aur har tehsil ka sarbarah Assistant Commissioner hota hai. Zameen ki fard, intiqal aur registry ke kaam tehsil ki satah se jure hote hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pakistan ki misaal ye hai. Zila Lahore me Lahore City, Model Town, Raiwind, Shalimar aur Cantt jaisi tehsilein hain. Har tehsil apne ilaqay ke dehat aur qasbon ko sambhalti hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Intizami seedhi yaad rakho. Soba, phir division, phir zila, phir tehsil, aur sab se neeche union council. Sawal aksar is tartib ko ulta seedha karke poochta hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Union Council"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Union council sab se chhoti intizami aur baldiyati ikai hai. Ye chand dehat ya sheher ke chand muhallon ko mila kar banti hai aur awam ke sab se qareeb hoti hai. Paidaish aur wafat ke certificate jese kaam yahin se hote hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pakistan ki misaal ye hai. Har gaon aur har shehri muhalla kisi na kisi union council me ata hai. Baldiyati intikhabat me chairman aur councilor isi satah par chune jate hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Union council ko sab se chhoti ikai ke tor par yaad rakho. Paper me sawal ata hai ke sab se chhoti intizami ikai konsi hai, jawab union council hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Sobai Darul Hukumat (Provincial Capital)"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Har sobay ka wo sheher jahan sobay ki hukumat, assembly aur wazir-e-aala ka daftar ho, use sobai darul hukumat kehte hain. Soba apne sare bare faisle usi sheher se chalata hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pakistan ki misaal ye hai. Punjab ka darul hukumat Lahore hai, Sindh ka Karachi, Khyber Pakhtunkhwa ka Peshawar aur Balochistan ka Quetta."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Gilgit-Baltistan ka darul hukumat Gilgit aur Azad Kashmir ka Muzaffarabad hai. Ye dono aksar bhool jate hain, is liye in par khaas tawajjo do."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Wafaqi Darul Hukumat (Federal Capital)"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Pure mulk ki hukumat jis sheher se chalti hai, jahan parliament, sadar aur wazir-e-azam ke daftar hain, use wafaqi darul hukumat kehte hain. Ye kisi sobay ka hissa nahi hota, is ka apna alag intizami darja hota hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pakistan ki misaal ye hai. Islamabad Pakistan ka wafaqi darul hukumat hai. Ye 1960 ki dahai me Karachi ki jagah naya darul hukumat banaya gaya tha aur Margalla ki pahariyon ke daman me basta hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Pakistan ka pehla darul hukumat Karachi tha, phir kuch arsa Rawalpindi raha, aur aakhir me Islamabad bana. Ye tartib paper me bohat ati hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Bandargah (Port)"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Samandar ke kinare wo jagah jahan bare jahaz rukte hain, samaan charhaya aur utara jata hai aur mulk ki tijarat chalti hai, use bandargah kehte hain. Bandargah mulk ka samandar ki taraf khulne wala darwaza hoti hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pakistan ki misaal ye hai. Karachi Port Pakistan ki sab se purani aur bari bandargah hai. Port Qasim bhi Karachi ke qareeb hai aur Gwadar Balochistan ke sahel par gehray pani ki jadeed bandargah hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Gwadar ko CPEC aur gehray samandar ke sath jor kar poochha jata hai. Aur ye bhi yaad rakho ke Pakistan ki tamam bandargahen Arabian Sea par hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Jheel (Lake)"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Chaaron taraf zameen se ghiri hui pani ki wo bari ikai jo darya se alag apni jagah bani ho, use jheel kehte hain. Kuch jheelein meethe pani ki hoti hain aur kuch khare pani ki."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pakistan ki misaal ye hai. Manchar Jheel Sindh me hai aur Pakistan ki sab se bari meethe pani ki jheel kahi jati hai. Shumali ilaaqon me Saiful Muluk aur Attabad jaisi khoobsurat jheelein hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Manchar ko sab se bari, Keenjhar ko Karachi ko pani dene wali, aur Saiful Muluk ko Naran ke sath jor kar yaad rakho. Attabad 2010 me pahar girne se bani thi, ye baat bhi ati hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aabshar (Waterfall)"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Jahan darya ya nala unchai se achanak neeche girta hai aur pani ki safed chaadar si ban jati hai, use aabshar kehte hain. Aabshar hamesha pahari ilaqay me hoti hai kyunke unchai wahin milti hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pakistan ki misaal ye hai. Haripur ke qareeb Noori Waterfall hai aur Swat me Jarogo Waterfall Pakistan ki unchi aabsharon me ginni jati hai. Abbottabad ke qareeb Sajikot bhi mashhoor hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Pakistan me aabsharen kam hain, is liye jab sawal aye to shumali pahari ilaaqay zehen me lao. Aabshar ko jheel se ulta samjho, jheel thehra pani hai aur aabshar girta hua pani."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Canal (Nehr)"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Nehr insaan ki banayi hui wo pani ki naali hai jo darya ya barrage se pani nikaal kar door door ki zameenon tak le jati hai. Nehr ka pani gharon ke liye nahi, zyada tar faslon ki aabpashi ke liye hota hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pakistan ki misaal ye hai. Lower Chenab Canal Faisalabad aur us ke gird ke ilaaqon ko serab karti hai. Pakistan ka nehri nizam duniya ke sab se bare aabpashi nizamon me ginna jata hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Har bari nehr ko us ke darya ke sath yaad rakho. Upper Jhelum Canal Jhelum se, Upper Chenab Canal Chenab se. Sawal aksar nehr ka naam de kar us ka darya poochta hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Link Canal"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Link canal wo khaas nehr hai jo aik darya ka pani dusre darya ki nehron tak pohanchati hai. Ye aam nehr se is liye alag hai ke ye zameen serab karne ke bajaye daryaaon ko aapas me jorti hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pakistan ki misaal ye hai. Chashma Jhelum Link Canal Indus ka pani Jhelum ki taraf le jati hai. Rasul Qadirabad aur Qadirabad Balloki bhi mashhoor link canals hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Link canals Indus Waters Treaty ke baad aham hui thin, jab mashriqi daryaaon ka pani Bharat ko mila to maghribi daryaaon ka pani link canals se mashriqi ilaaqon tak pohanchaya gaya. Ye wajah paper me ati hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Headworks"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Headworks darya par wo maqam aur dhancha hai jahan se nehrein nikaali jati hain aur pani ka bahao control kiya jata hai. Asaan alfaaz me, nehron ka shuru hone wala darwaza headworks hota hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pakistan ki misaal ye hai. Balloki Headworks darya-e-Ravi par hai aur wahan se Lower Bari Doab Canal nikalti hai. Sulemanki Headworks darya-e-Sutlej par hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Headworks aur barrage qareeb qareeb ki cheezein hain, farq bas ye hai ke headworks nehron ke nikalne ke maqam par zyada zor deta hai. Balloki ko Ravi aur Sulemanki ko Sutlej ke sath pakka kar lo."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Silsila (Mountain Range)"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Paharon ki wo lambi qataar jo aik hi simt me door tak phaili ho, use pahari silsila kehte hain. Aik pahar akela hota hai, lekin jab bohat se pahar aik line me jur jayen to silsila ban jata hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pakistan ki misaal ye hai. Karakoram, Himalaya aur Hindu Kush Pakistan ke teen mashhoor silsile hain aur teeno shumal me milte hain. Maghrib me Sulaiman aur Kirthar silsile hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Har silsile ko us ki sab se unchi choti ke sath yaad rakho. Karakoram ke sath K2, Himalaya ke sath Nanga Parbat, Hindu Kush ke sath Tirich Mir. Ye jore paper ki jaan hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Choti (Peak)"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Kisi pahar ya silsile ka sab se uncha nuqta choti kehlata hai. Choti ki unchai samandar ki satah se naapi jati hai aur feet ya metre me batayi jati hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pakistan ki misaal ye hai. K2 Pakistan ki sab se unchi aur duniya ki dusri sab se unchi choti hai, is ki unchai 8,611 metre hai. Nanga Parbat 8,126 metre ke sath Pakistan ki dusri bari choti hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Chotiyon ki tartib wala sawal bohat ata hai. K2, phir Nanga Parbat, phir Gasherbrum One, phir Broad Peak aur phir Gasherbrum Two. Ye unchai wali seedhi pakki kar lo."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Wadi (Valley)"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Do pahari silsilon ke darmiyan wo neechi aur lambi zameen jahan aksar darya behta hai aur log rehte hain, use wadi kehte hain. Wadi paharon ke darmiyan zindagi ki jagah hoti hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pakistan ki misaal ye hai. Hunza Valley, Swat Valley aur Skardu Valley Pakistan ki mashhoor wadiyan hain. Azad Kashmir ki Neelum Valley bhi bohat mashhoor hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Har wadi ko us ke darya ke sath yaad rakho. Hunza ke sath Hunza darya, Swat ke sath darya-e-Swat, Neelum ke sath darya-e-Neelum. Sawal aksar wadi aur darya ka jora poochta hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Jazira (Island)"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Pani ke darmiyan wo zameen jo chaaron taraf se pani se ghiri ho aur mainland se kati hui ho, use jazira kehte hain. Jazira samandar me bhi hota hai aur bari jheel ya darya me bhi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pakistan ki misaal ye hai. Astola Jazira Balochistan ke sahel ke qareeb Arabian Sea me hai aur Pakistan ka sab se bara jazira hai. Karachi ke qareeb Bundal aur Manora jazeere hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Astola ko Haft Talar bhi kaha jata hai aur ye Pakistan ka sab se bara jazira hai. Jazira suno to Astola aur Gwadar ke aas paas ka sahel zehen me lao."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Sahil (Coast)"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Wo kinara jahan zameen khatam aur samandar shuru hota hai, use sahil kehte hain. Sahil par bandargahen, machhli ke ilaqay aur samandari hawa ka asar hota hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pakistan ki misaal ye hai. Pakistan ka sahil takhreeban 1,046 kilometre lamba hai. Is ka aik hissa Sindh me Karachi se Thatta tak hai aur bara hissa Balochistan me Makran ka sahil hai jahan Gwadar hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Sahil ki lambai 1,046 kilometre pakki kar lo aur ye bhi ke Pakistan ka sahil sirf do sobon, Sindh aur Balochistan, ke sath lagta hai. Punjab aur Khyber Pakhtunkhwa ka koi sahil nahi."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Aakhri baat"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab tumhare paas har lafz ki pehchan hai. Aage jab naqshay par koi nishan dekho ge to pehle khud se poochho ge ke ye hai kya, doab hai ya plateau, dam hai ya barrage. Yehi aik sawal aadhe number pakke kar deta hai. Agli files me yehi alfaaz asal jagahon ke sath milenge, aur har jagah ko tum in lafzon se pehchan sako ge."),
    ],
  ),
  GeoTopic(
    id: "provinces",
    title: "Pakistan ke Sobay aur Zilay",
    subtitle: "Intizami dhancha, har sobay ki pehchan, aur zilon ki taaza tadaad",
    blocks: <LessonBlock>[
      LessonBlock.heading("Ye topic kyun zaroori hai"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("PPSC ke paper me Pakistan Studies ke sab se zyada dohraye jane wale sawalon me aik sawal zaroor hota hai ke falan sobay me kitne zilay hain, ya sab se zyada zilay kis sobay me hain, ya falan sobay ka darul hukumat kya hai. Ye sawal mushkil nahi hote, bas tadaad taza honi chahiye kyunke naye zilay bante rehte hain. Is file me hum pehle pura intizami dhancha samjhen ge, phir aik aik sobay ko us ki pehchan ke sath parhen ge. Jo student ye file aik dafa samajh kar parh le, us ke ye number kabhi nahi kat te."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Pehle intizami dhancha samajh lo"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pakistan aik wafaq hai, yani ikhtiyar markaz aur sobon me banta hua hai. Sab se upar wafaqi hukumat hai jo Islamabad se chalti hai. Us ke neeche sobay hain. Pakistan ke chaar sobay hain, Punjab, Sindh, Khyber Pakhtunkhwa aur Balochistan. In ke ilawa Gilgit-Baltistan aur Azad Jammu-o-Kashmir ke apne intizami nizamon ke sath alag ilaqay hain, aur Islamabad ka wafaqi darul hukumat wala ilaqa hai jo kisi sobay ka hissa nahi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab sobay ke andar ki seedhi samjho. Soba sab se bari ikai hai aur us ki hukumat sobai darul hukumat se chalti hai, jahan wazir-e-aala aur sobai assembly hoti hai. Sobay ko divisions me banta jata hai. Division kai zilon ka majmua hota hai aur us ka sarbarah Commissioner hota hai. Division ke neeche zila ata hai, jo intizam ki sab se aham ikai hai aur us ka sarbarah Deputy Commissioner, yani DC, hota hai. Zilay ke andar tehsilein hoti hain jin ka sarbarah Assistant Commissioner hota hai, aur sab se neeche union council hai jo awam ke sab se qareeb hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Bas ye seedhi zehen me bitha lo. Wafaq, soba, division, zila, tehsil, union council. Paper is tartib ko bhi poochta hai aur har satah ke sarbarah ko bhi."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Aik ehtiyaat pehle hi sun lo"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Is file me di gayi zilon ki tadaad 2026 ki tadaad hai. Pakistan me sobai hukumatein waqtan fawaqtan naye zilay aur nayi divisions banati rehti hain, is liye purani kitabon me tadaad kam milti hai. 2026 me Balochistan ne apna intizami dhancha naye sire se tarteeb diya, jis se us ke zilay aur divisions barh gaye. Isi tarah Khyber Pakhtunkhwa me bhi naye zilay bane. To jab bhi koi tadaad yaad karo, ye zehen me rakho ke ye mojooda tadaad hai aur naye elan ke baad badal sakti hai. Paper hamesha taaza tadaad ko durust manta hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Punjab"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Punjab Pakistan ka sab se zyada abadi wala soba hai aur is ka darul hukumat Lahore hai. Is ka raqba 205,344 murabba kilometre hai aur 2023 ki mardum shumari ke mutabiq is ki abadi takhreeban 12 crore 77 lakh hai, jo pure mulk ki abadi ka aadhe se zyada hissa hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Punjab me 10 divisions hain aur 41 zilay hain. Divisions ke naam ye hain. Lahore, Gujranwala, Gujrat, Rawalpindi, Sargodha, Faisalabad, Sahiwal, Multan, Dera Ghazi Khan aur Bahawalpur. Gujrat Division nisbatan nayi hai, is liye purani kitabon me divisions 9 milti hain, lekin mojooda tadaad 10 hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baatein ye hain. Abadi me sab se bara soba Punjab hai. Paanch daryaaon ki zameen yehi hai aur Pakistan ki sab se zyada zarai paidawar yahin se ati hai. Lahore ko Pakistan ka dil kaha jata hai. Aur ye bhi yaad rakho ke Punjab ke 41 zilay taweel arse tak mulk me sab se zyada rahe, lekin 2026 ki tabdeeliyon ke baad Balochistan bhi 41 zilon ke sath is ke barabar agaya hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Sindh"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Sindh ka darul hukumat Karachi hai, jo Pakistan ka sab se bara sheher aur mulk ki maashi jaan hai. Sobay ka raqba 140,914 murabba kilometre hai aur 2023 ki mardum shumari ke mutabiq abadi takhreeban 5 crore 57 lakh hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Sindh me 6 divisions hain aur 30 zilay hain. Divisions ke naam ye hain. Karachi, Hyderabad, Sukkur, Larkana, Mirpur Khas aur Shaheed Benazirabad. Karachi sheher khud saat zilon me banta hua hai, ye baat aksar sawal banti hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baatein ye hain. Pakistan ki sab se bari bandargah Karachi yahin hai aur Port Qasim bhi isi sobay me hai. Darya-e-Indus apne safar ka aakhri hissa Sindh me tay karke Arabian Sea me girta hai aur Indus Delta yahin banta hai. Mohenjo-daro ki purani tehzeeb Larkana ke qareeb hai. Aur Karachi mulk ka wo sheher hai jo Pakistan ka pehla darul hukumat tha."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Khyber Pakhtunkhwa"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Khyber Pakhtunkhwa ka darul hukumat Peshawar hai, jo Pakistan ke sab se purane shehron me se hai. Sobay ka raqba 101,741 murabba kilometre hai. 2018 me FATA ke ilaqay is sobay me zam hue, jis ke baad is ka raqba aur abadi dono barh gaye. 2023 ki mardum shumari ke mutabiq abadi takhreeban 4 crore 9 lakh hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Is sobay me 7 divisions hain aur 40 zilay hain. Divisions ke naam ye hain. Peshawar, Mardan, Hazara, Malakand, Kohat, Bannu aur Dera Ismail Khan. Zilon ki tadaad haal hi ke barson me naye zilon ke banne se barhi hai, is liye purani kitabon me kam tadaad milti hai, lekin mojooda tadaad 40 hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baatein ye hain. Khyber Darra isi sobay me hai aur Afghanistan ki sarhad bhi isi sobay se milti hai. Zam shuda qabaeli ilaqay, jinhen pehle FATA kaha jata tha, ab isi sobay ka hissa hain, ye baat paper me bohat ati hai. Warsak Dam Peshawar ke qareeb darya-e-Kabul par hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Balochistan"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Balochistan raqbe me Pakistan ka sab se bara soba hai aur is ka darul hukumat Quetta hai. Is ka raqba 347,190 murabba kilometre hai, jo pure Pakistan ke raqbe ka takhreeban 44 feesad banta hai. Lekin abadi me ye sab se chhota soba hai, 2023 ki mardum shumari ke mutabiq takhreeban 1 crore 49 lakh."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("2026 me Balochistan ne apne intizami dhanchay ki bari tarteeb-e-nau ki, jis ke baad sobay me 11 divisions aur 41 zilay ho gaye hain. Is se pehle 8 divisions aur 36 zilay ginne jate the, is liye purani kitabon aur purane notes me wahi tadaad milegi. Mojooda tadaad 11 divisions aur 41 zilay hai. Divisions ke naam ye hain. Quetta, Pishin, Zhob, Loralai, Koh-e-Sulaiman, Sibi, Naseerabad, Khuzdar, Lasbela, Makran aur Rakhshan."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baatein ye hain. Raqbe me sab se bara aur abadi me sab se chhota soba, ye jora Balochistan ki pehchan hai. Pakistan ki sab se lambi sahel patti isi sobay me hai aur Gwadar ki bandargah bhi yahin hai. Bolan Darra, Hanna Jheel aur Quetta ke seb aur khushk meve mashhoor hain. Aur zilon ki tadaad me Balochistan ab Punjab ke barabar 41 par hai, ye taaza baat paper me a sakti hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Gilgit-Baltistan"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Gilgit-Baltistan ka darul hukumat Gilgit hai. Ye ilaqa Pakistan ke intehai shumal me hai jahan duniya ke teen bare pahari silsile, Karakoram, Himalaya aur Hindu Kush, aapas me milte hain. Is ka raqba 72,971 murabba kilometre hai aur abadi takhreeban 15 lakh ke qareeb hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Gilgit-Baltistan me 3 divisions hain aur 14 zilay hain. Divisions ke naam ye hain. Gilgit, Baltistan aur Diamer."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baatein ye hain. Duniya ki dusri sab se unchi choti K2 isi ilaqay me hai aur duniya ke bare glaciers bhi yahin hain. China ki sarhad aur Khunjerab Darra bhi isi ilaqay se jure hain aur CPEC ka shumali darwaza yehi hai. Gilgit-Baltistan ko sobay ka baqaida darja hasil nahi, is ka apna alag intizami nizam hai, ye farq bhi paper me ata hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Azad Jammu-o-Kashmir"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Azad Jammu-o-Kashmir ka darul hukumat Muzaffarabad hai. Ye ilaqa Pakistan ke shumal mashriq me hai aur is ka raqba 13,297 murabba kilometre hai. Abadi takhreeban 40 lakh se zyada hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Azad Kashmir me 3 divisions hain aur 10 zilay hain. Divisions ke naam ye hain. Muzaffarabad, Poonch aur Mirpur."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baatein ye hain. Mangla Dam Mirpur ke qareeb hai aur us ka zakhira Azad Kashmir ki zameen par hai, is liye Mangla ko aksar Azad Kashmir ke sath jor kar poochha jata hai. Neelum Valley aur darya-e-Neelum bhi mashhoor hain. Line of Control isi ilaqay ko Bharat ke zir-e-intizam Kashmir se alag karti hai. Azad Kashmir ki apni assembly aur apna alag nizam hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Islamabad Capital Territory"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Islamabad Pakistan ka wafaqi darul hukumat hai aur ye kisi sobay ka hissa nahi. Is ka raqba 906 murabba kilometre hai, jo sab se chhota intizami ilaqa hai, aur 2023 ki mardum shumari ke mutabiq abadi takhreeban 23 lakh 64 hazar hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Islamabad me koi division nahi hai aur ye aik hi zila ginna jata hai. Is ka intizam wafaqi hukumat ke zeir-e-asar chalta hai aur sheher sectors me banta hua hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baatein ye hain. Islamabad 1960 ki dahai me Karachi ki jagah naya darul hukumat banaya gaya tha. Margalla pahariyan, Faisal Masjid, Pakistan Monument aur Rawal Jheel is ki pehchan hain. Ye bhi yaad rakho ke Rawalpindi Punjab me hai aur Islamabad alag ilaqa hai, dono judwaan sheher kehlate hain lekin intizami tor par alag hain."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Kul tadaad wali baat"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab zara saari tadaad jama karke dekh lo. Punjab 41, Sindh 30, Khyber Pakhtunkhwa 40, Balochistan 41, Gilgit-Baltistan 14, Azad Kashmir 10 aur Islamabad 1. In sab ko jama karen to pure Pakistan me kul 177 zilay bante hain. Agar Islamabad ko alag rakhen to baqi ilaaqon ke 176 zilay hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Divisions ki kul tadaad 37 hai. Punjab 10, Sindh 6, Khyber Pakhtunkhwa 7, Balochistan 11, Gilgit-Baltistan 3 aur Azad Kashmir 3, aur Islamabad me koi division nahi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aakhri mashwara ye hai ke zilon ki tadaad ko hamesha taaza rakhna. Jab bhi kisi sobay me naya zila banne ki khabar aye, apni tadaad usi din durust kar lo, kyunke paper hamesha wohi tadaad durust manta hai jo paper wale saal me mojood ho. Aur ye teen jore kabhi mat bhoolna. Sab se bara soba raqbe me Balochistan, sab se bara abadi me Punjab, aur sab se zyada zilay Punjab aur Balochistan dono me 41, 41."),
    ],
  ),
  GeoTopic(
    id: "movement",
    title: "Tehreek-e-Pakistan",
    subtitle: "1857 se 1947 tak, har waqia tartib se",
    blocks: <LessonBlock>[
      LessonBlock.heading("Ye hissa kyun zaroori hai"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Dekho, Pak Studies ke one paper me Tehreek-e-Pakistan wo khana hai jahan se sawal ana tay hai. Har saal koi na koi tareekh, koi na koi waqia, koi na koi qarardad paper me mojood hoti hai. Masla ye hota hai ke students waqiat ko alag alag ratte hain, aur jab do milti julti tareekhen samne ati hain, jaise 1906 aur 1909, ya 1929 aur 1930, to dimagh ulajh jata hai. Is liye hum is pure safar ko aik kahani ki tarah parhenge. 1857 ki haar se shuru karenge, phir dekhenge ke kesay aik khoi hui qaum ne pehle taleem pakri, phir apni alag siyasat banai, phir apna mutalba wazeh kiya, aur aakhir me 14 August 1947 ko apna mulk hasil kar liya. Kahani tartib se zehen me beth jaye to tareekhen khud yaad ho jati hain, kyunke har waqia apne pichle waqie ka jawab hota hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aik mashwara pehle se de dun. Jab bhi koi waqia parho, teen cheezain pakki karo. Saal kya hai, hua kya tha, aur is ka nateeja kya nikla. Paper ka sawal hamesha inhi teen me se banta hai. Chalo shuru karte hain."),
      LessonBlock.heading("1857 ki Jang-e-Azadi"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ye kahani ki pehli aur sab se talkh tareekh hai. 10 May 1857 ko Meerut se baghawat shuru hui aur dekhte hi dekhte Delhi, Lucknow aur Kanpur tak phail gayi. Is jang me Hindu aur Musalman kandhe se kandha mila kar Angrez ke khilaf lare. Baghiyon ne Delhi par qabza karke budhe Mughal badshah Bahadur Shah Zafar ko apna rehnuma aur badshah-e-Hind bana liya. Yaad rakho, Bahadur Shah Zafar Mughal khandan ke aakhri badshah the. Jang ki fori wajah nayi Enfield rifle ke wo kartoos the jin par gay aur suar ki charbi ka shak tha, lekin asal wajahen barson ki na-insafi, Angrez ki tawsee pasand policy aur mazhabi dakhal andazi thi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Jang nakam hui aur is ki qeemat sab se zyada Musalmanaan ne chukai. Angrez ne badla Musalmanaan se liya, kyunke wo inhen is baghawat ka asal zimmedar samajhta tha. Bahadur Shah Zafar ko giraftar karke Rangoon, yani Burma, jalawatan kar diya gaya, jahan 1862 me un ki wafat hui. Delhi me Musalmanaan par zulm ke pahar tore gaye, un ki jaidaden zabt huin aur sarkari mulazmaton ke darwaze un par band ho gaye. Paper me is waqie se teen sawal bante hain. Aakhri Mughal badshah kon tha, Zafar. Zafar ko kahan jalawatan kiya gaya, Rangoon. Aur Jang-e-Azadi kis saal hui, 1857. Teeno pakke kar lo."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Sir Syed Ahmad Khan aur Aligarh Tehreek"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("1857 ke baad Musalman taleem, rozgar aur izzat, har medan me sab se peeche reh gaye the. Us andhere me sab se pehle roshni Sir Syed Ahmad Khan ne dikhai. Unhon ne kaha ke Musalmanaan ko Angrezon se narazgi aur purani rivayaton se chipke rehne ke bajaye jadeed English taleem hasil karni chahiye aur Angrezon ke sath taluqat behtar karne chahiye, warna ye qaum hamesha peeche rahegi. Unhon ne 1864 me Scientific Society banai taake English kitabon ka Urdu me tarjuma ho, aur 1870 me apna mashhoor risala Tahzib-ul-Akhlaq nikala. Sir Syed ko do qaumon ke farq ka bhi ehsas hua aur yahin se do qaumi nazriye ki buniyad parti hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aligarh Tehreek ka sab se bara karnama MAO wala idara hai, aur is ki teen tareekhen paper ki jaan hain. 1875 me Aligarh me MAO School qaim hua. 1877 me ye idara MAO College ban gaya, is ka sang-e-buniyad us waqt ke Viceroy Lord Lytton ne rakha tha. Aur 1920 me yehi college Aligarh Muslim University ban gaya. Tartib yaad rakho, pehle school, phir college, phir university. Paper me aam taur par poochha jata hai ke MAO College kab bana, jawab 1877, aur Muslim University kab bani, jawab 1920. Sir Syed ki wafat 1898 me Aligarh me hui."),
      LessonBlock.heading("1885, Congress ki buniyad"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("December 1885 me Bombay me Indian National Congress ki buniyad rakhi gayi. Is ke bani aik retire Angrez afsar A. O. Hume the, aur is ke pehle sadar W. C. Bonnerjee bane. Shuru me Congress ne daawa kiya ke wo tamam Hindustaniyon ki jamaat hai, lekin waqt ke sath ye wazeh hota gaya ke is par Hindu aksariyat aur un ke mufadat ka ghalba hai. Sir Syed Ahmad Khan ne Musalmanaan ko Congress se door rehne ka mashwara diya, kyunke un ka khayal tha ke jamaat me Musalman hamesha aqliyat me dab jayenge."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper me is se do seedhe sawal bante hain. Congress kab bani, 1885. Aur Congress kis ne banai, A. O. Hume ne. Is ke sath ye baat bhi zehen me rakho ke Congress ki buniyad ke baad hi Musalmanaan ko apni alag siyasat ki zaroorat mehsoos hona shuru hui, aur aage chal kar yahi ehsas Muslim League ki surat me samne aya."),
      LessonBlock.heading("1905, Bengal ki taqseem"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("16 October 1905 wo tareekh hai jis din Bengal ki taqseem amal me aayi. Viceroy Lord Curzon ne intizami asani ka bahana karke bare sobe Bengal ko do hisson me baant diya. Maghribi hissa Bengal hi raha, aur mashriqi hisson ko Assam ke sath mila kar naya soba Mashriqi Bengal-o-Assam banaya gaya, jis ka darul hukumat Dhaka tha. Is naye sobe me Musalman aksariyat me the, is liye Musalmanaan ne taqseem ka khair maqdam kiya. Dhaka ke Nawab Salimullah is ke bare hamiyon me the."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Lekin Hindu rehnumaon ne is ke khilaf shadeed tehreek chalai, Swadeshi Tehreek ke naam se Angrezi maal ka boycott hua aur pora Bengal hangamon ki zad me aa gaya. Paper me is waqie se sawal yun banta hai. Bengal ki taqseem kis Viceroy ke dor me hui, Lord Curzon. Taqseem kab amal me aayi, 16 October 1905. Aur naye sobe ka darul hukumat kya tha, Dhaka. Ye bhi yaad rakho ke taqseem ke is puray tajurbe ne Musalmanaan ko sikha diya ke apne huqoq ke liye unhen apni alag jamaat banana hi hogi."),
      LessonBlock.heading("1906, Muslim League ki buniyad"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab ati hai wo tareekh jahan se Pakistan ki kahani asal me shuru hoti hai. 30 December 1906 ko Dhaka me All India Muslim League ki buniyad rakhi gayi. Ye ijlas Muhammadan Educational Conference ke salana ijlas ke mauqe par Dhaka ke Shahbagh me hua, aur nayi jamaat ki tajveez Nawab Salimullah ne pesh ki. Sir Aga Khan ko Muslim League ka pehla aur mustaqil sadar muntakhib kiya gaya, aur Mohsin-ul-Mulk jamaat ke secretary bane."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Muslim League ke maqasid wazeh the. Musalmanaan ke huqoq aur mufadat ki hifazat karna, hukumat ke sath wafadari ke taluqat barqarar rakhna, aur dosri qaumon ke sath dostana taluqat ko farogh dena. Isi saal, yani 1906 me, aik aur aham waqia hua tha. October 1906 me Aga Khan ki qiyadat me Musalmanaan ke 35 rukni wafd ne Simla me Viceroy Lord Minto se mulaqat ki, jisay Simla Deputation kehte hain, aur alag intikhabat ka mutalba pesh kiya. Paper me Muslim League se sawal har saal ata hai. League kab bani, 30 December 1906. Kahan bani, Dhaka me. Pehla sadar kon tha, Sir Aga Khan. Teeno jawab ratne ke bajaye kahani se jor kar yaad rakho, Dhaka ki sarzameen, jahan chand maah pehle Musalmanaan ko apna soba mila tha, wahi un ki jamaat ki paidayish ki jagah bani."),
      LessonBlock.heading("1909, Minto-Morley Islahat aur alag intikhabat"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("1909 me Indian Councils Act aya, jo is ke banane walon, Secretary of State Lord Morley aur Viceroy Lord Minto, ke naam par Minto-Morley Islahat kahlata hai. Is act ka Musalmanaan ke liye sab se aham tohfa judda gana intikhabat, yani separate electorates, tha. Is ka matlab ye hua ke Muslim ummeedwar ko sirf Musalman vote denge aur Muslim halqon se sirf Musalman hi muntakhib hoga. Simla Deputation ka mutalba poora ho gaya tha."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Alag intikhabat ki ahemiyat samajh lo, kyunke paper me is par sawal bar bar ata hai. Is usool ne pehli dafa qanooni taur par ye tasleem kar liya ke Hindustan ke Musalman aik alag qaum hain jin ke numainday alag muntakhib honge. Yahi woh buniyad hai jis par aage chal kar do qaumi nazriya khara hua. Sawal yun banta hai, Musalmanaan ko alag intikhabat kis act me mile, 1909 ke Minto-Morley Act me."),
      LessonBlock.heading("1911, Bengal ki taqseem ki wapsi"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("December 1911 me Delhi Darbar ke mauqe par Badshah George V ne khud Hindustan aa kar Bengal ki taqseem ki mansoookhi ka elan kar diya. Taqseem wapas le li gayi aur sath hi Hindustan ka darul hukumat Calcutta se Delhi muntaqil karne ka bhi elan hua. Musalmanaan ke liye ye bohat bara dhachka tha. Unhon ne mehsoos kiya ke Angrez sirf us ki sunta hai jo dabao dale, aur ye ke un ke mufadat ki koi zamanat nahi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Is wapsi ka nateeja ye nikla ke Musalmanaan ka Congress aur Angrez dono par se bharosa hil gaya, aur apni alag siyasat par un ka yaqeen aur pukhta ho gaya. Paper me sawal seedha banta hai, Bengal ki taqseem kab mansoookh hui, 1911 me. Aik aur baat jo aksar poochhi jati hai ke darul hukumat Calcutta se Delhi kab muntaqil hua, ye bhi 1911 ke elan se hi jura hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("1913, Muslim League ke maqasid me tabdeeli"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("1913 Muslim League ki tareekh ka mor hai. Is saal League ne apne maqasid me tabdeeli karke Hindustan ke liye khud ikhtiyari, yani self-government, ko apna hadaf bana liya. Ab League sirf huqoq ki hifazat nahi chahti thi, wo mulk ke nizam me apna hissa bhi chahti thi. Isi saal aik aur bohat aham waqia hua. Muhammad Ali Jinnah ne 1913 me Muslim League join kar li. Jinnah us waqt Congress ke bhi rukn the aur un ki sab se bari khwahish Hindu Muslim ittehad thi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper me 1913 se do sawal bante hain. Muslim League ne self-government ko maqsad kab banaya, 1913 me. Aur Quaid-e-Azam ne Muslim League kab join ki, 1913 me. In dono ko aik sath yaad rakho, kyunke yehi wo saal hai jab mustaqbil ke Quaid aur mustaqbil ki jamaat pehli dafa aik saf par aye."),
      LessonBlock.heading("1916, Lucknow Pact"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("December 1916 me Lucknow ke maqam par Congress aur Muslim League ke ijlas aik hi waqt me hue aur dono jamaaton ke darmiyan aik tareekhi muahida tay paya, jisay Lucknow Pact kehte hain. Is muahide me Congress ne pehli dafa Musalmanaan ke alag intikhabat ko tasleem kar liya, aur dono jamaaton ne mil kar Angrezon se islahat ka mushtarka mutalba pesh kiya. Ye Hindu Muslim ittehad ka sab se uncha nuqta tha."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Is muahide ke asal mehmaan Muhammad Ali Jinnah the. Unhon ne hi dono jamaaton ko aik table par bithaya tha. Isi koshish par mashhoor Hindu rehnuma Sarojini Naidu ne Jinnah ko Ambassador of Hindu-Muslim Unity ka khitab diya. Paper me sawal yun ata hai, Lucknow Pact kab hua, 1916 me. Congress ne alag intikhabat kab tasleem kiye, Lucknow Pact me. Aur Jinnah ko ittehad ka safeer kis ne kaha, Sarojini Naidu ne. Teeno baatein aik hi kahani ki karriyan hain."),
      LessonBlock.heading("1919, Islahat, Rowlatt Act aur Jallianwala Bagh"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("1919 teen bare waqiat ka saal hai. Pehla, Montagu-Chelmsford Islahat ke tehet Government of India Act 1919 aya, jis ne sobon me do amli nizam, yani dyarchy, mutarif karaya. Dusra, hukumat ne Rowlatt Act pass kiya, jis ke tehet kisi ko bhi baghair muqadma chalaye jail me rakha ja sakta tha. Awam ne isay kala qanoon kaha aur is ke khilaf pora mulk uth khara hua. Teesra aur sab se khooni waqia Jallianwala Bagh ka hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("13 April 1919 ko Amritsar ke Jallianwala Bagh me aik pur aman jalse par General Dyer ne baghair kisi warning ke goliyan chalwa dein. Bagh ke chaaron taraf unchi deewarein thin aur nikalne ka sirf aik tang rasta tha, jo fouj ne band kar diya tha. Sainkadon log shaheed aur hazaron zakhmi hue. Is waqie ne Angrez raaj par awam ka aitmaad hamesha ke liye khatam kar diya. Paper me tareekh ke sath naam bhi poochha jata hai, Jallianwala Bagh kahan hai, Amritsar me. Zimmedar officer kon tha, General Dyer. Aur waqia kab hua, 13 April 1919 ko."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Khilafat Tehreek, 1919 se 1924"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pehli Aalmai Jang me Turkey, yani Saltanat-e-Usmania, Angrezon ke khilaf lara tha. Jang ke baad Angrezon ne Turkey ke sath sakht sulook kiya aur Khilafat khatam karne ki baten hone lagin. Hindustan ke Musalmanaan ke liye Khalifa mazhabi rehnuma tha, is liye Khilafat ki hifazat ke liye 1919 me Khilafat Tehreek shuru hui. Is ke rehnuma do bhai the, Maulana Muhammad Ali Johar aur Maulana Shaukat Ali, jinhen Ali Brothers kaha jata hai. Mahatma Gandhi ne bhi is tehreek ki himayat ki aur is ke sath apni Adam Taawun, yani Non-Cooperation, tehreek jor di."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("1920 me Hijrat Tehreek bhi chali, jis me hazaron Musalman Hindustan ko dar-ul-harb samajh kar Afghanistan ki taraf hijrat kar gaye, lekin wahan se mayus lotna para. 1922 me Chauri Chaura ke waqie ke baad Gandhi ne apni tehreek wapas le li, jis se Musalman bohat mayus hue. Aur 1924 me Mustafa Kemal Ataturk ne Turkey me Khilafat ka idara hi khatam kar diya, jis ke sath ye tehreek bhi apne anjaam ko pohnchi. Paper me sawal bante hain, Khilafat Tehreek ke rehnuma kon the, Ali Brothers. Tehreek kab se kab tak chali, 1919 se 1924 tak. Aur Khilafat kis ne khatam ki, Mustafa Kemal Ataturk ne."),
      LessonBlock.heading("1927, Delhi Proposals"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("March 1927 me Delhi ke maqam par Muslim rehnumaon ne aik ijlas me chaar aham tajaveez pesh kein, jinhen Delhi Proposals kaha jata hai. Jinnah is koshish ke ruh-e-rawan the. Tajaveez ye theen. Sindh ko Bombay se alag karke alag soba banaya jaye. Sarhadi sobe, yani NWFP, aur Balochistan me dosre sobon jaisi islahat di jayen. Punjab aur Bengal me Musalmanaan ko un ki abadi ke tanasub se numaindagi mile. Aur markazi assembly me Musalmanaan ko aik tihai, yani one third, nashistain milen."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("In tajaveez ki ahemiyat ye thi ke Musalman is ke badle me alag intikhabat chorne par bhi tayyar the, bashart ye mutalbat man liye jayen. Ye ittehad ki aakhri sanjeeda koshishon me se aik thi. Paper me sawal banta hai ke Delhi Proposals kab pesh hue, 1927 me, aur in me total kitni tajaveez theen, chaar. Sindh ki alahdagi ka mutalba is me pehli dafa baqaida tor par samne aya tha, ye bhi yaad rakho."),
      LessonBlock.heading("1928, Nehru Report"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("1927 me Angrez hukumat ne Simon Commission bheja tha jis me aik bhi Hindustani shaamil nahi tha, is liye tamam jamaaton ne is ka boycott kiya. Jawab me Congress ne Motilal Nehru ki sarbarahi me aik committee banai jis ne 1928 me apni report pesh ki, yehi Nehru Report hai. Is report ne Musalmanaan ke alag intikhabat ko radd kar diya aur mushtarka intikhabat ki sifarish ki. Delhi Proposals ki shartein bhi is me manzoor na huin. Sindh ki alahdagi aur markaz me aik tihai numaindagi jaise mutalbat nazar andaz kar diye gaye."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Nehru Report Musalmanaan ke liye bohat bara dhachka sabit hui. Jinnah ne isay rahain juda hone ka nuqta, yani parting of the ways, kaha. Paper me sawal yun banta hai. Nehru Report kab ayi, 1928 me. Is committee ke sarbarah kon the, Motilal Nehru. Aur is report ne kis cheez ko radd kiya, alag intikhabat ko. Nehru Report ke baad hi Jinnah ne apne mashhoor Chauda Nuqaat pesh kiye, dono ko hamesha jor kar yaad rakho, pehle report, phir us ka jawab."),
      LessonBlock.heading("1929, Quaid-e-Azam ke 14 Nuqaat"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("March 1929 me Delhi ke maqam par Muslim League ke ijlas me Muhammad Ali Jinnah ne apne mashhoor Chauda Nuqaat, yani Fourteen Points, pesh kiye. Ye asal me Nehru Report ka jawab aur Musalmanaan ke mutalbat ka mukammal manshoor tha. Aham nuqaat ye the. Hindustan ka aayeen wafaqi ho aur ikhtiyarat sobon ke pas hon. Tamam sobon ko barabar khud mukhtari mile. Har assembly me Musalmanaan ki munasib numaindagi ho aur koi bhi bill us waqt pass na ho jab us qaum ke teen chothai arakeen us ke khilaf hon. Alag intikhabat barqarar rahen. Markazi assembly me Musalmanaan ko aik tihai nashistain milen. Sindh ko Bombay se alag kiya jaye, NWFP aur Balochistan me islahat hon, aur sarkari mulazmaton me Musalmanaan ka hissa muqarrar ho."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper me 14 Nuqaat se sawal tay hai. Ye kis ne pesh kiye, Muhammad Ali Jinnah ne. Kab pesh hue, 1929 me. Aur ye kis ke jawab me the, Nehru Report ke. Aik baat aur zehen me bitha lo, 1929 ke baad se Musalmanaan ke mutalbat ka markaz hamesha yehi 14 Nuqaat rahe, aur yehi do qaumi nazriye ki siyasat ki sab se wazeh dastaveez hain."),
      LessonBlock.heading("1930, Iqbal ka Allahabad Khutba"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("29 December 1930 ko Allama Iqbal ne Allahabad ke maqam par Muslim League ke salana ijlas ki sadarat ki aur apna tareekhi Khutba-e-Allahabad pesh kiya. Is khutbe me Iqbal ne pehli dafa baqaida aur wazeh alfaz me mutalba kiya ke shimal maghribi Hindustan ke Muslim aksariyati ilaaqon, Punjab, NWFP, Sindh aur Balochistan, ko mila kar aik alag Muslim riyasat banayi jaye. Iqbal ne kaha ke Islam aik mukammal zabta-e-hayat hai aur Musalmanaan ko apni tehzeeb ke mutabiq zindagi guzarne ke liye apni alag riyasat chahiye."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Is khutbe ki ahemiyat ye hai ke Pakistan ka khayal sab se pehle aik wazeh siyasi mutalbe ki surat me yahin samne aya. Isi liye Allama Iqbal ko Musawwir-e-Pakistan kaha jata hai, yani Pakistan ka tasawwur dene wala. Paper me sawal bante hain. Allahabad Khutba kis ne diya, Allama Iqbal ne. Kab diya, 29 December 1930 ko. Aur is me kis cheez ka mutalba tha, shimal maghrib me alag Muslim riyasat ka. Tareekh samet teeno baatein pakki kar lo, ye one paper ka sab se pasandeeda sawal hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Gol Maiz Conferenceain, 1930 se 1932"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Hindustan ke aayeeni masle ko hal karne ke liye London me teen Gol Maiz Conferenceain, yani Round Table Conferences, huin. Pehli 1930 me hui, Congress ne is ka boycott kiya aur Gandhi sharik na hue, lekin Muslim League ke rehnuma, Aga Khan, Jinnah aur Muhammad Ali Johar, is me sharik hue. Maulana Muhammad Ali Johar ka inteqal isi doran London me hua. Dusri conference 1931 me hui, Gandhi Irwin muahide ke baad Gandhi is me Congress ke wahid numainday ki haisiyat se sharik hue, lekin ye bhi kisi nateeje par na pohnchi. Teesri conference 1932 me hui aur wo bhi nakam rahi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper me aam sawal ye banta hai ke Gol Maiz Conferenceain kul kitni huin, teen. Kahan huin, London me. Aur dusri conference me Congress ki numaindagi kis ne ki, Mahatma Gandhi ne. Conferenceaon ki nakami ne ye sabit kar diya ke Hindustan ka aayeeni masla beth kar tay nahi hoga, aur yehi nakami aage ke sakht faislon ki zameen bani."),
      LessonBlock.heading("1932, Communal Award"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("August 1932 me Bartanwi Wazir-e-Azam Ramsay MacDonald ne Communal Award ka elan kiya. Is ke tehet Musalmanaan ke alag intikhabat ko barqarar rakha gaya aur ye sahoolat dosri aqliyaton tak bhi barha di gayi. Gandhi ne is ke khilaf marne tak ki bhook hartal ki dhamki di, khaas taur par achedule caste ke alag intikhabat par, jis ke baad Poona Pact hua."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper me sawal seedha hota hai. Communal Award kab aya, 1932 me. Kis ne diya, Bartanwi Wazir-e-Azam Ramsay MacDonald ne. Aur is ne Musalmanaan ko kya diya, alag intikhabat ki zamanat. Isay Nehru Report se mila kar dekho to kahani saaf hoti hai, Congress alag intikhabat khatam karna chahti thi, aur Communal Award ne unhen phir se pukhta kar diya."),
      LessonBlock.heading("1935 ka Act"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Government of India Act 1935 Tehreek-e-Pakistan ke is dor ki sab se aham qanoon sazi hai. Ye us waqt ka sab se lamba act tha. Is ke tehet sobon ko khud mukhtari, yani provincial autonomy, di gayi aur sobon me do amli nizam khatam kar diya gaya. Markaz me aik wafaq, yani federation, banane ki tajveez thi, lekin wo hissa kabhi nafaz nahi ho saka kyunke riyasaton ne shamooliyat se inkar kar diya. Sobai hissa nafaz hua aur isi act ke tehet 1937 ke intikhabat hue."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper me sawal yun banta hai. 1937 ke intikhabat kis act ke tehet hue, 1935 ke Act ke tehet. Is act ne sobon ko kya diya, khud mukhtari. Aur ye bhi yaad rakho ke Pakistan aur Bharat dono ke pehle aayeen isi 1935 ke act ki buniyad par chale, is liye ye act dono mulkon ki tareekh me aham hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("1937 ke intikhabat aur Congress ki wazaratain"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("1935 ke Act ke tehet 1937 me sobai intikhabat hue. Congress ne bare paimane par kamyabi hasil ki aur aath sobon me apni wazaratain, yani hukumatein, bana lein. Muslim League in intikhabat me achhi karkardagi na dikha saki. Congress ne Muslim League ke sath iqtedar me shirkat se inkar kar diya aur League ke ummeedwaron ko Congress me zam hone ki shart rakhi. Yahan se dono jamaaton ke darmiyan talkhi apne urooj par pohnch gayi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Congress ki wazaraton ka dor 1937 se 1939 tak raha, aur Musalmanaan ke liye ye dor talkh tajurbon se bhara tha. Bande Mataram ko qaumi tarana bana kar lazmi karna, Hindi ko farogh dena, taleemi idaron me Hindu tehzeeb ki jhalak aur Wardha Scheme jaise iqdamat ne Musalmanaan ko mehsoos karaya ke Congress ki hukumat me un ki tehzeeb aur mazhab mehfooz nahi. Muslim League ne in zulm-o-ziyadation ko Jama karne ke liye Raja Muhammad Mehdi ki sarbarahi me committee banai, jis ki mashhoor Pirpur Report 1938 me samne aayi. Paper me sawal bante hain. Congress ki wazaratain kitne arse rahin, 1937 se 1939 tak. Pirpur Report kis bare me thi, Congress ke dor me Musalmanaan par hue zulm ke bare me. Aur is ne League ko ye kehne ka mauqa diya ke Musalman Congress ke raaj me kabhi mehfooz nahi reh sakte."),
      LessonBlock.heading("1939, Youm-e-Nijat"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("1939 me Dusri Aalmai Jang shuru hui to Viceroy ne Hindustan ki jamaaton se poochhe baghair mulk ko jang me sharik karne ka elan kar diya. Ehtejajan Congress ki wazaraton ne October aur November 1939 me istefay de diye. Musalmanaan ke liye ye 1937 se chale ane wale talkh dor ka khatima tha. Muhammad Ali Jinnah ne 22 December 1939 ko Youm-e-Nijat, yani Day of Deliverance, manane ka elan kiya. Us din pora Hindustan ke Musalmanaan ne Congress ki wazaraton ke khatme par Allah ka shukar ada kiya."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper me tareekh wala sawal tay hai. Youm-e-Nijat kab manaya gaya, 22 December 1939 ko. Kis ke elan par manaya gaya, Quaid-e-Azam ke. Aur kis khushi me manaya gaya, Congress ki wazaraton ke istefon par. Ye tareekh 1940 ki Lahore Resolution se chand maah pehle ki hai, dono ko tartib me jor kar yaad rakho, pehle Nijat, phir mutalba."),
      LessonBlock.heading("23 March 1940, Qarardad-e-Lahore"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab ati hai is puri kahani ki sab se aham tareekh. 22 se 24 March 1940 tak Lahore ke Minto Park me Muslim League ka tareekhi ijlas hua, jis ki sadarat Quaid-e-Azam ne ki. 23 March 1940 ko Bengal ke Wazir-e-Aala A. K. Fazlul Haq, jinhen Sher-e-Bangla kaha jata hai, ne wo mashhoor qarardad pesh ki jo tareekh me Qarardad-e-Lahore ke naam se amar ho gayi. Qarardad ka mutalba ye tha ke shimal maghribi aur mashriqi ilaaqon me jahan Musalman aksariyat me hain, un ki alag aur khud mukhtar riyasatain qaim ki jayen."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aik baat khaas taur par samajh lo, kyunke paper is par phansata hai. Qarardad ke asal matn me lafz Pakistan istemal hi nahi hua tha. Hindu akhbarat aur press ne isay tanzen Pakistan Resolution ka naam diya, aur yehi naam tareekh me chal para. Baad me isi tareekh ki yaad me 23 March ko Pakistan Day manaya jata hai. Paper me sawal bante hain. Qarardad kis ne pesh ki, A. K. Fazlul Haq ne. Kahan pesh hui, Lahore ke Minto Park me, jisay aaj Iqbal Park kaha jata hai. Aur kab pesh hui, 23 March 1940 ko. Teeno sawal har paper me ghumte hain."),
      LessonBlock.heading("1942, Cripps Mission aur Quit India"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("March 1942 me Dusri Aalmai Jang ke dabao me Bartania ne Sir Stafford Cripps ko aik tajveez ke sath Hindustan bheja, jisay Cripps Mission kaha jata hai. Tajveez ye thi ke jang ke baad Hindustan ko dominion ka darja diya jayega aur sobon ko ye ikhtiyar hoga ke wo naye aayeen ko qabool karen ya na karen. Is akhri shart me alag riyasat ke imkan ka pehla ishara mojood tha. Gandhi ne is tajveez ko post-dated cheque kaha aur Congress ne isay radd kar diya. Muslim League ne bhi isay is liye radd kiya ke is me Pakistan ka wazeh elan nahi tha."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Isi saal, August 1942 me, Congress ne Quit India, yani Hindustan Chhor Do, tehreek shuru ki aur Gandhi ne Do or Die ka nara diya. Hukumat ne fori taur par Congress ki qiyadat ko giraftar kar liya aur tehreek dab gayi. Muslim League ne is tehreek se alag rehne ka faisla kiya. Paper me sawal bante hain. Cripps Mission kab aya, 1942 me. Cripps tajveez ko post-dated cheque kis ne kaha, Gandhi ne. Aur Quit India tehreek kab chali, August 1942 me."),
      LessonBlock.heading("1944, Gandhi Jinnah Muzakarat"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("September 1944 me Bombay me Mahatma Gandhi aur Muhammad Ali Jinnah ke darmiyan barah-e-rast muzakarat hue. Ye mulaqatein Rajagopalachari Formula ki buniyad par theen, jis me jang ke baad Muslim aksariyati ilaaqon me rai shumari, yani plebiscite, ke zariye faisle ki tajveez thi. Dono rehnuma kayi dafa mile, lekin koi muahida na ho saka. Gandhi Pakistan ko jang se pehle tasleem karne par tayyar nahi the aur Jinnah ka mauqif tha ke Pakistan ka usool pehle mana jaye, tafseel baad me tay hogi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper me sawal aam taur par itna banta hai. Gandhi Jinnah muzakarat kab hue, 1944 me. Kahan hue, Bombay me. Aur ye kis formula ki buniyad par the, Rajagopalachari Formula par. In muzakarat ki nakami ke baad ye wazeh ho gaya ke Pakistan ka faisla ab muzakarat se nahi, siyasi taqat aur intikhabat se hoga."),
      LessonBlock.heading("1945, Simla Conference"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("June 1945 me Viceroy Lord Wavell ne Simla me tamam jamaaton ki conference bulai, jisay Simla Conference kehte hain. Wavell Plan ke tehet markazi executive council me Hindustaniyon ko sharik karna tha aur Hindu Muslim numaindagi barabar rakhni thi. Conference is nuqte par nakam hui ke Muslim League ka mutalba tha ke tamam Muslim arakeen ki namzadgi sirf League karegi, kyunke wahi Musalmanaan ki wahid numainda jamaat hai. Congress is par raazi na hui aur conference kisi nateeje ke baghair khatam ho gayi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper me sawal banta hai. Simla Conference kis Viceroy ne bulai, Lord Wavell ne. Kab hui, 1945 me. Aur nakami ki wajah kya thi, Muslim arakeen ki namzadgi ka tanaza. Ye waqia is liye bhi aham hai ke is ke baad Muslim League ne apna yehi daawa intikhabat me sabit karke dikhaya."),
      LessonBlock.heading("1945 aur 46 ke intikhabat"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("1945 ke aakhir me markazi assembly ke aur 1946 ke shuru me sobai assemblies ke intikhabat hue. Muslim League ne in intikhabat ko Pakistan par rai shumari bana diya. Nateeja tareekhi tha. Markazi assembly me Muslim League ne Musalmanaan ki tamam tees nashistain jeet lein. Sobai intikhabat me bhi League ne Muslim nashiston ki bohat bari aksariyat hasil ki. Jo jamaat 1937 me kamzor thi, wo ab Musalmanaan ki wahid awaz ban chuki thi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("In intikhabat ke baad bane wali aburi hukumat, yani Interim Government, me Muslim League bhi sharik hui aur Liaquat Ali Khan Wazir-e-Khazana bane. Unhon ne apne pehle budget se Congress ko khaasa pareshan kiya, aur dono jamaaton ka ikathhe chalna na mumkin ho gaya. Paper me sawal bante hain. 1945-46 ke intikhabat me Muslim League ne markaz me Muslim nashistain kitni jeetin, tamam tees ki tees. Aur aburi hukumat me League ki taraf se Wazir-e-Khazana kon the, Liaquat Ali Khan. Ye intikhabat Pakistan ke qiyam ki sab se mazboot siyasi buniyad hain, ye jumla zehen me bitha lo."),
      LessonBlock.heading("1946, Cabinet Mission"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("March 1946 me Bartania ki hukumat ne teen wazeeron par mushtamil aik mission Hindustan bheja, jisay Cabinet Mission kaha jata hai. Is ke arakeen Lord Pethick-Lawrence, Sir Stafford Cripps aur A. V. Alexander the. Mission ne aik aisa hal pesh kiya jis me Pakistan ka mutalba baqaida taur par radd kar diya gaya, lekin sobon ko teen groups me baant kar Muslim aksariyati sobon ko apne group me reh kar bohat si khud mukhtari dene ki tajveez di gayi. Markaz ke pas sirf defa, kharja aur mawasilat jaise chand shobay rehne the."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Dono jamaaton ne pehle is mansube ko mashroot taur par qabool kiya, lekin phir ikhtilafat ubhar aye aur Muslim League ne apni razamandi wapas le li. Paper me sawal bante hain. Cabinet Mission kab aya, 1946 me. Is me kitne arakeen the, teen. Aur is ne Pakistan ke mutalbe ke sath kya kiya, usay radd karke grouping ka mansuba diya. Mission ki nakami ke baad seedhi karwai ke elawa koi rasta na bacha tha, aur kahani apne aakhri mor par aa gayi thi."),
      LessonBlock.heading("16 August 1946, Direct Action Day"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Jab Muslim League ne Cabinet Mission Plan ki razamandi wapas le li to Quaid-e-Azam ne 16 August 1946 ko Direct Action Day, yani Youm-e-Barah-e-Rast Iqdaam, manane ka elan kiya. Maqsad Bartanwi hukumat aur Congress par dabao dalna tha ke Musalmanaan ko un ka haq, yani Pakistan, diya jaye. Bengal me Muslim League ki hukumat thi aur wahan is din aam chutti ki gayi. Calcutta me shadeed fasadat phoot pare, jinhen Great Calcutta Killing kaha jata hai, aur hazaron log mare gaye. Fasadat phir Bihar aur dosre ilaaqon tak phail gaye."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper me tareekh wala sawal tay hai. Direct Action Day kab manaya gaya, 16 August 1946 ko. Kis ne elan kiya, Quaid-e-Azam ne. Aur sab se bare fasadat kahan hue, Calcutta me. Is din ke baad ye baat sab par wazeh ho gayi ke Hindu aur Musalman ab aik mulk me aman se nahi reh sakte, aur taqseem ke baghair koi hal nahi."),
      LessonBlock.heading("3 June 1947 ka Mansuba"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("February 1947 me Bartanwi hukumat ne Lord Mountbatten ko Hindustan ka aakhri Viceroy bana kar bheja aur June 1948 tak iqtedar muntaqil karne ka elan kiya. Mountbatten ne tamam rehnumaon se mulaqaton ke baad 3 June 1947 ko apna mansuba pesh kiya, jisay 3 June Plan ya Mountbatten Plan kehte hain. Is ke tehet Bengal aur Punjab ki taqseem ka faisla hua, NWFP aur Assam ke Sylhet zila me referendum hona tha, aur dono nayi riyasaton ki sarhadon ke liye Boundary Commission bana jis ke sarbarah Sir Cyril Radcliffe the."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper me sawal bante hain. 3 June Plan kis ne pesh kiya, Lord Mountbatten ne. Punjab aur Bengal ki sarhad bandi kis ne ki, Radcliffe ne. Aur NWFP me Pakistan ya Bharat ke liye faisla kis zariye hua, referendum ke zariye, jis me aksariyat ne Pakistan ke haq me vote diya. Is mansube ko Congress aur Muslim League dono ne qabool kar liya, aur is ke sath Pakistan ka banna tay ho gaya. Bas tareekh ka elan baqi tha."),
      LessonBlock.heading("July 1947, Indian Independence Act"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("July 1947 me Bartanwi Parliament ne Indian Independence Act pass kiya, jisay 18 July 1947 ko shahi manzoori mili. Is act ke tehet 15 August 1947 se Hindustan ko do azaad dominionon, Pakistan aur Bharat, me taqseem karne ka qanoon ban gaya. Har dominion ko apna Governor General muqarrar karne ka ikhtiyar mila aur Bartanwi Parliament ki Hindustan par hukumat khatam ho gayi. Yehi wo qanoon hai jis ki ro se Pakistan qanooni taur par wajood me aya."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper me sawal seedha banta hai. Indian Independence Act kab pass hua, July 1947 me. Is act ne kitni riyasatain banayen, do, Pakistan aur Bharat. Aur ye baat bhi yaad rakho ke is act ke baad Quaid-e-Azam Pakistan ke pehle Governor General muqarrar hue aur Bartania ke badshah ne un ki taqrari ki manzoori di."),
      LessonBlock.heading("14 August 1947, Pakistan ban gaya"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aur phir wo din aa gaya jis ke liye ye puri sadi ki jaddojehad thi. 14 August 1947 ko Pakistan duniya ke naqshe par aik azaad mulk ki surat me ubhra. Karachi ko pehla darul hukumat banaya gaya. Quaid-e-Azam Muhammad Ali Jinnah Pakistan ke pehle Governor General bane aur Liaquat Ali Khan pehle Wazir-e-Azam. 11 August 1947 ko Quaid-e-Azam ne Karachi me Pakistan ki pehli Aayeen Saaz Assembly se apni tareekhi taqreer ki thi, jis me unhon ne kaha tha ke har shehri ko apne mazhab ke mutabiq zindagi guzarne ki mukammal azaadi hogi aur riyasat ki nazar me sab barabar honge."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aik khaas baat jo har Pakistani ko yaad hai aur paper me bhi ati hai, 14 August 1947 ki raat Islami tareekh ke hisab se 27 Ramzan-ul-Mubarak thi, wo mubarak raat jo Laylat-ul-Qadr ki raaton me se hai. Isi liye kaha jata hai ke Pakistan Ramzan ke mubarak maah me aur 27 Ramzan ki raat ko wajood me aya. Taqseem ke sath lakhon logon ki hijrat aur fasadat ka talkh silsila bhi chala, aur naye mulk ko khali khazane, na mukammal daftar aur mehajireen ke samandar jaisi mushkilat ka samna tha. Lekin is sab ke bawajood 1857 se shuru hone wala safar apni manzil par pohnch chuka tha. Paper me aakhri sawal tay hai. Pakistan kab bana, 14 August 1947 ko. Pehla darul hukumat konsa tha, Karachi. Pehle Governor General kon the, Quaid-e-Azam. Aur pehle Wazir-e-Azam, Liaquat Ali Khan."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Aakhir me puri kahani aik nazar me"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aao aakhir me is pure safar ko aik sans me dohra lein, taake tartib kabhi na bhoole. 1857 me haar hui aur Zafar Rangoon gaye. Sir Syed ne taleem ka rasta dikhaya, 1875 me school, 1877 me college aur 1920 me university bani. 1885 me Congress bani to Musalmanaan ko apni siyasat ki zaroorat mehsoos hui. 1905 me Bengal taqseem hua, 1906 me Dhaka me Muslim League bani, 1909 me alag intikhabat mile aur 1911 me taqseem ki wapsi ne sab ko chaunka diya. 1913 me League ne self-government ka hadaf apnaya aur Jinnah League me aye. 1916 me Lucknow Pact hua, 1919 me Jallianwala aur phir Khilafat Tehreek chali. 1927 me Delhi Proposals aye, 1928 me Nehru Report ne unhen radd kiya, 1929 me Jinnah ne 14 Nuqaat diye aur 1930 me Iqbal ne alag riyasat ka tasawwur pesh kiya. 1935 ke Act ke baad 1937 ke intikhabat aur Congress ki wazaraton ke talkh tajurbe ne 1939 me Youm-e-Nijat tak pohnchaya. 1940 me Lahore me Pakistan ka mutalba qarardad bana. Phir Cripps, Gandhi Jinnah muzakarat, Simla Conference aur 1945-46 ke intikhabat me League ki faisla kun kamyabi ayi. 1946 me Cabinet Mission nakam hua aur Direct Action Day ke baad taqseem tay ho gayi. 3 June 1947 ke mansube aur July ke Independence Act ke baad 14 August 1947 ko Pakistan ban gaya."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Is tartib ko do teen dafa bol kar dohra lo. Phir paper me koi bhi tareekh aye, tum use is kahani ki sahi karri par rakh kar jawab de sako ge. Yehi is pure hisse ka asal faida hai, tareekhen ratna nahi, kahani yaad karna."),
    ],
  ),
  GeoTopic(
    id: "leaders",
    title: "Bare Rehnuma",
    subtitle: "Jin logon ne Pakistan banaya",
    blocks: <LessonBlock>[
      LessonBlock.heading("Ye hissa kyun zaroori hai"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Dekho, Pak Studies ke one paper me jitne sawal tareekhon par bante hain, utne hi sawal shakhsiyaton par bante hain. Kis ki paidaish kab hui, kon pehla sadar tha, kon sa khitab kis ko mila, kon kahan dafan hai. Ye sawal mushkil nahi hote, lekin masla ye hai ke naam aur tareekhen apas me mil jati hain. Is liye har rehnuma ko hum us ki kahani ke sath parhenge. Pehle ye samjho ke ye shakhs tha kon aur us ne kiya kya, phir us ki tareekhen aur paper wale facts khud zehen me beth jayenge. Tartib bhi wazeh kar dun, pehle wo buzurg aayenge jinhon ne buniyad rakhi, phir Quaid aur un ke sathi, aur aakhir me wo rehnuma jo is safar ke aham moron par khare nazar ate hain."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Sir Syed Ahmad Khan, 1817 se 1898"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Sir Syed Ahmad Khan 17 October 1817 ko Delhi me paida hue aur 27 March 1898 ko Aligarh me un ka inteqal hua. 1857 ki nakami ke baad jab Musalman har medan me pase hue the, Sir Syed ne unhen jadeed taleem aur Angrezon se behtar taluqat ka rasta dikhaya. Unhon ne 1858 me Asbab-e-Baghawat-e-Hind likh kar Angrezon ko bataya ke jang ki asal wajahen kya theen. Scientific Society, Tahzib-ul-Akhlaq aur Aligarh ka idara un ke bare karnamay hain. Hindu aur Musalman ko do alag qaumain kehne ki wajah se inhen do qaumi nazriye ke banion me shumar kiya jata hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper me Sir Syed se ye sawal bante hain. Paidaish 1817 Delhi me, wafat 1898 Aligarh me. MAO College kis ne banaya, Sir Syed ne. Aur Aligarh Tehreek ke bani kon hain, ye bhi Sir Syed hi hain. Inhen wo pehla shakhs samjho jis ne girri hui qaum ko uthne ka pehla sabq diya, taleem."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Allama Muhammad Iqbal, 1877 se 1938"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Allama Iqbal 9 November 1877 ko Sialkot me paida hue aur 21 April 1938 ko Lahore me inteqal farma gaye. Pakistan banne se nau saal pehle hi wo is duniya se rukhsat ho gaye, lekin Pakistan ka khayal sab se pehle inhi ki zubaan se siyasi mutalbe ki surat me nikla. Iqbal ko Shair-e-Mashriq kaha jata hai, aur Pakistan ka tasawwur dene ki wajah se inhen Musawwir-e-Pakistan ka khitab mila. 9 November ko har saal Iqbal Day manaya jata hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Iqbal ki shaairi ne soi hui qaum ko jhijhora. Bang-e-Dra, Bal-e-Jibril aur Zarb-e-Kaleem un ke mashhoor majmooye hain. Khudi ka falsafa un ki pehchan hai. Paper me sawal bante hain. Iqbal ki paidaish kahan hui, Sialkot me. Allahabad Khutba kab diya, 1930 me. Iqbal Day kab manaya jata hai, 9 November ko. Aur Iqbal kahan dafan hain, Lahore me Badshahi Masjid ke pehlu me. Ye aakhri baat aksar paper me ati hai, pakki yaad rakho."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Quaid-e-Azam Muhammad Ali Jinnah, 1876 se 1948"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab ate hain is kahani ke sab se bare naam par. Muhammad Ali Jinnah 25 December 1876 ko Karachi me paida hue. Qanoon ki taleem ke liye London gaye aur Lincoln's Inn se bar-at-law ki degree li, us waqt wo Hindustan ke sab se kam umr barristeron me se the. Watan wapas aa kar Bombay me wakalat shuru ki aur jald hi Hindustan ke maane hue qanoon dan ban gaye. 1906 me Congress join ki, 1913 me Muslim League me aye, aur Lucknow Pact 1916 ke asal mehmaan hone par inhen Hindu Muslim ittehad ka safeer kaha gaya."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Lekin jab Congress ka rawaiya badla aur Nehru Report ne Musalmanaan ke huqoq radd kar diye to Jinnah ne 1929 me apne 14 Nuqaat pesh kiye aur phir do qaumi nazriye ke sab se mazboot wakeel ban gaye. 1940 ki Qarardad-e-Lahore ke baad se wo Musalmanaan ke wahid aur sab se bare rehnuma the, isiliye qaum ne inhen Quaid-e-Azam, yani sab se bara rehnuma, ka khitab diya. 14 August 1947 ko wo Pakistan ke pehle Governor General bane. 11 August 1947 ko Aayeen Saaz Assembly se un ki taqreer aaj bhi Pakistan ke aayeen ki rooh samjhi jati hai. 11 September 1948 ko Karachi me un ka inteqal hua aur wo Karachi hi me dafan hain, un ke mazaar ko Mazar-e-Quaid kaha jata hai. Paper me sawal tay hain. Paidaish 25 December 1876 Karachi me, is din Quaid-e-Azam Day manaya jata hai. Pehle Governor General kon the, Quaid-e-Azam. Aur un ka mazaar kahan hai, Karachi me."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Liaquat Ali Khan, 1895 se 1951"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Liaquat Ali Khan 1 October 1895 ko Karnal me paida hue. Taleem Aligarh aur Oxford se hasil ki. Quaid-e-Azam ke sab se qareebi aur bharose mand sathi the, isiliye unhen Quaid ka dast-e-rast kaha jata hai. Muslim League ke general secretary rahe, aburi hukumat me Wazir-e-Khazana bane, aur Pakistan banne ke baad mulk ke pehle Wazir-e-Azam muqarrar hue. 1949 me unhon ne Aayeen Saaz Assembly se Qarardad-e-Maqasid, yani Objectives Resolution, pass karayi, jo Pakistan ke har aayeen ki buniyad hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("16 October 1951 ko Rawalpindi ke Company Bagh me aik jalse se khitab ke doran unhen goli maar kar shaheed kar diya gaya. Us bagh ka naam baad me un ke naam par Liaquat Bagh rakh diya gaya. Liaquat Ali Khan ko Shaheed-e-Millat ka khitab mila. Paper me sawal bante hain. Pakistan ke pehle Wazir-e-Azam kon the, Liaquat Ali Khan. Qarardad-e-Maqasid kab pass hui, 1949 me. Aur Liaquat Ali Khan kahan shaheed hue, Rawalpindi ke Liaquat Bagh me. Tareekh 16 October 1951 bhi sath yaad rakho."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Fatima Jinnah, 1893 se 1967"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Fatima Jinnah Quaid-e-Azam ki chhoti behan theen. Wo 1893 me Karachi me paida huin aur pesha ke aitbar se dentist theen. Apni zindagi ka bara hissa unhon ne apne bhai ki khidmat aur un ke siyasi kaam me madad me guzara. Pakistan banne ke baad wo khawateen ki taleem aur huqoq ke liye kaam karti rahin. Qaum ne inhen izzat se Madar-e-Millat, yani qaum ki maan, ka khitab diya."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("1965 me Fatima Jinnah ne us waqt ke sadar Ayub Khan ke muqable me sadarti intikhab lara aur pora mulk un ke gird ikatha ho gaya. Wo intikhab to na jeet sakin, lekin is muqabilay ne mulk me jamhoori tehreek ko nayi zindagi di. 9 July 1967 ko Karachi me un ka inteqal hua aur wo apne bhai ke pehlu me Karachi me dafan hain. Paper me sawal bante hain. Madar-e-Millat kis ko kaha jata hai, Fatima Jinnah ko. Unhon ne sadarti intikhab kab lara, 1965 me. Aur wo kis ki behan theen, Quaid-e-Azam ki. Un ki kitab My Brother bhi un ke bhai ki zindagi par aham maloomat ka zariya hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Sir Aga Khan III, 1877 se 1957"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Sir Sultan Muhammad Shah Aga Khan III 2 November 1877 ko Karachi me paida hue. Wo Ismaili firqe ke imam the aur apne daur ke sab se asar-o-rasookh wale Muslim rehnumaon me se aik the. October 1906 me un ki qiyadat me Musalmanaan ke 35 rukni wafd, yani Simla Deputation, ne Viceroy Lord Minto se mulaqat karke alag intikhabat ka mutalba pesh kiya tha. December 1906 me jab Dhaka me Muslim League bani to unhen hi jamaat ka pehla aur mustaqil sadar muntakhib kiya gaya."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aga Khan ne Aligarh ke idare ke liye dil khol kar atiyaat diye aur Musalmanaan ki taleem ke liye hamesha kaam kiya. 1937 me wo League of Nations ke sadar bhi bane, jo us daur ki duniya ki sab se bari tanzeem thi. 1957 me un ka inteqal hua. Paper me sawal bante hain. Muslim League ke pehle sadar kon the, Sir Aga Khan. Simla Deputation ki qiyadat kis ne ki, Aga Khan ne. Aur Simla Deputation kab gaya, 1906 me. In teeno sawalon ka jawab aik hi shakhs hai, is liye ye naam kabhi nahi bhoolta."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Maulana Muhammad Ali Johar, 1878 se 1931"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Maulana Muhammad Ali Johar 10 December 1878 ko Rampur me paida hue. Aligarh aur Oxford ke taleem yafta the, lekin un ki pehchan Khilafat Tehreek ke aatish bayan rehnuma ki hai. Apne bhai Maulana Shaukat Ali ke sath mil kar unhon ne Khilafat aur Adam Taawun ki tehreekon ko gali gali pohncha diya. Unhon ne English akhbar Comrade aur Urdu akhbar Hamdard nikale, jin ki tehreerain logon me josh bhar deti theen."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("1930 me wo pehli Gol Maiz Conference me sharik hone London gaye. Wahan unhon ne apni mashhoor baat kahi ke wo watan azaad ho kar lotenge ya yahin dafan honge. 4 January 1931 ko London hi me un ka inteqal ho gaya aur un ki wasiyat ke mutabiq unhen Bait-ul-Muqaddas, yani Jerusalem, me dafan kiya gaya. Paper me sawal bante hain. Khilafat Tehreek ke bare rehnuma kon the, Ali Brothers, yani Muhammad Ali Johar aur Shaukat Ali. Maulana Johar ka inteqal kahan hua, London me. Aur wo dafan kahan hain, Jerusalem me. Ye aakhri sawal paper ka pasandeeda hai, aksar students inhen Hindustan me dafan samajhte hain."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Maulana Shaukat Ali, 1873 se 1938"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Maulana Shaukat Ali, Maulana Muhammad Ali Johar ke bare bhai the. Wo 1873 me Rampur me paida hue aur Aligarh se taleem hasil ki. Khilafat Tehreek me dono bhai aik dosre ke kandhe se kandha milaye rahe, isiliye tareekh unhen hamesha Ali Brothers ke naam se aik sath yaad karti hai. Shaukat Ali apni buland awaz, lambe qad aur purjosh taqreeron ki wajah se jalson ki jaan hote the. Jail ki sakhtiyan bhi dono bhaiyon ne sath bardasht kein."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Apne chhote bhai ki wafat ke baad bhi Maulana Shaukat Ali Muslim League aur Muslim maqasid ke liye sargarm rahe. 26 November 1938 ko Delhi me un ka inteqal hua. Paper me sawal aam taur par jori ki surat me banta hai. Ali Brothers se murad kon hain, Maulana Muhammad Ali Johar aur Maulana Shaukat Ali. Bara bhai kon tha, Shaukat Ali. Aur dono ka taluq kis tehreek se sab se zyada jura hai, Khilafat Tehreek se. Jori yaad rakhoge to koi sawal ghalat nahi hoga."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Chaudhry Rehmat Ali, 1897 se 1951"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Chaudhry Rehmat Ali 16 November 1897 ko Punjab ke ilaaqe Balachaur me paida hue. Wo Cambridge University ke talib ilm the jab unhon ne wo kaam kiya jis ne un ka naam hamesha ke liye amar kar diya. 28 January 1933 ko unhon ne Cambridge se apna mashhoor pamphlet Now or Never nikala, jis me pehli dafa is naye mulk ke liye lafz Pakistan tajveez kiya gaya. Lafz Pakistan ka matlab hai pak logon ki sarzameen, aur ye naam unhon ne paanch ilaaqon ke pehle harfon ko jor kar banaya tha. P se Punjab, A se Afghania yani NWFP, K se Kashmir, S se Sindh aur TAN se Balochistan."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Chaudhry Rehmat Ali ne Pakistan National Movement ke naam se tanzeem bhi banai aur apni puri zindagi is khayal ki tableegh me guzari. Ajeeb baat ye hai ke jis shakhs ne mulk ko naam diya, wo khud Pakistan me bas na saka. 1951 me Cambridge hi me un ka inteqal hua aur wo wahin dafan hain. Paper me sawal tay hain. Lafz Pakistan kis ne tajveez kiya, Chaudhry Rehmat Ali ne. Kab tajveez kiya, 1933 me. Aur kis pamphlet me, Now or Never me. Teeno sawal aik hi kahani se nikalte hain."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Huseyn Shaheed Suhrawardy, 1892 se 1963"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Huseyn Shaheed Suhrawardy 8 September 1892 ko Bengal ke ilaaqe Midnapore me paida hue. Oxford ke taleem yafta the aur Bengal ki siyasat ke bare rehnuma the. 1946 ke intikhabat ke baad wo Bengal ke Wazir-e-Aala bane, aur Direct Action Day ke fasadat ke waqt Bengal ki hukumat unhi ke pas thi. Quaid-e-Azam ke qareebi sathion me shumar hote the aur Muslim League ki aala qiyadat ka hissa the."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pakistan banne ke baad Suhrawardy ne Awami League ki buniyad me aham kirdar ada kiya aur 1956 me Pakistan ke Wazir-e-Azam bane. Wo is ohde par taqreeban aik saal rahe. 5 December 1963 ko Beirut me un ka inteqal hua aur Dhaka me dafan hue. Paper me sawal bante hain. Suhrawardy kis sobe ke rehnuma the, Bengal ke. Wo Pakistan ke Wazir-e-Azam kab bane, 1956 me. Aur 1946 me Bengal ke Wazir-e-Aala kon the, ye bhi Suhrawardy hi the."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Khawaja Nazimuddin, 1894 se 1964"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Khawaja Nazimuddin 19 July 1894 ko Dhaka me paida hue. Wo Bengal ke bare zaimindar khandan se taluq rakhte the aur Muslim League ke purane aur wafadar rehnumaon me se the. Pakistan banne ke waqt wo Mashriqi Bengal ke Wazir-e-Aala the. Quaid-e-Azam ke inteqal ke baad September 1948 me wo Pakistan ke dusre Governor General bane. Phir 1951 me Liaquat Ali Khan ki shahadat ke baad unhon ne Governor General ka ohda chor kar mulk ke dusre Wazir-e-Azam ki zimmedari sambhali aur 1953 tak is ohde par rahe."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ye tartib khaas taur par yaad rakho, kyunke paper is me phansata hai. Pehle Governor General Quaid-e-Azam, dusre Khawaja Nazimuddin. Pehle Wazir-e-Azam Liaquat Ali Khan, dusre Khawaja Nazimuddin. Yani dono ohdon par dusra number aik hi shakhs ka hai. 22 October 1964 ko Dhaka me un ka inteqal hua. Paper me sawal bante hain. Pakistan ke dusre Governor General kon the, Khawaja Nazimuddin. Dusre Wazir-e-Azam kon the, ye bhi Khawaja Nazimuddin. Aik shakhs, do dusre number, yehi is sawal ki jaan hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("A. K. Fazlul Haq, 1873 se 1962"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Abul Kasem Fazlul Haq 26 October 1873 ko Bengal ke ilaaqe Barisal me paida hue. Apne ilaaqe ke ghareeb kisanon ke huqoq ke liye awaz uthane ki wajah se awam ne inhen Sher-e-Bangla, yani Bengal ka sher, ka khitab diya. Unhon ne Krishak Praja Party banai aur Bengal ke Wazir-e-Aala rahe. Muslim League aur Congress dono ke ijlason me un ki baat wazan rakhti thi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Tareekh me un ka naam 23 March 1940 ki wajah se amar hai. Lahore ke Minto Park me Muslim League ke tareekhi ijlas me Qarardad-e-Lahore unhi ne pesh ki thi. Socho, qarardad Lahore me pesh hui, lekin pesh karne wala Bengal ka rehnuma tha, yehi is tehreek ki wusat ka saboot hai ke Pakistan ka mutalba kisi aik sobe ka nahi, pure Hindustan ke Musalmanaan ka tha. Paper me sawal tay hai. Qarardad-e-Lahore kis ne pesh ki, A. K. Fazlul Haq ne. Sher-e-Bangla kis ko kaha jata hai, Fazlul Haq ko. 27 April 1962 ko Dhaka me un ka inteqal hua."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Aakhir me aik nazar"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aao is pure khandan ko aik nazar me dohra lein. Sir Syed ne taleem di, 1817 se 1898. Iqbal ne khayal diya, 1877 se 1938, aur un ka din 9 November hai. Quaid-e-Azam ne khayal ko mulk bana diya, 1876 se 1948, un ka din 25 December hai. Liaquat Ali Khan pehle Wazir-e-Azam bane aur 1951 me Rawalpindi me shaheed hue. Fatima Jinnah Madar-e-Millat kahlayen aur 1965 me sadarti intikhab lara. Aga Khan League ke pehle sadar the aur Simla Deputation ke rehnuma. Ali Brothers ne Khilafat Tehreek chalai, Johar London me inteqal karke Jerusalem me dafan hue. Chaudhry Rehmat Ali ne 1933 me mulk ko naam diya. Suhrawardy Bengal ke rehnuma aur baad me Wazir-e-Azam bane. Khawaja Nazimuddin dono ohdon par dusre number par aye. Aur Fazlul Haq ne 1940 me qarardad pesh ki."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Agar tum har naam ke sath us ka aik khaas kaam jor kar yaad rakho, naam aur kaam, to shakhsiyaton ke sawal kabhi ghalat nahi honge. Yahi is pure hisse ka asaan sa raaz hai."),
    ],
  ),
  GeoTopic(
    id: "constitutions-govt",
    title: "Aaeen aur Hukumat",
    subtitle: "Pakistan ke teen aaeen, hukumat ka dhancha, aur sadar aur wazeer-e-azam ki tartib",
    blocks: <LessonBlock>[
      LessonBlock.heading("Ye lesson kyun zaroori hai"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("One paper me Pak Studies ke hisse me aaeen par har saal sawal ata hai. Kabhi poochte hain 1973 ka aaeen kab nafiz hua, kabhi poochte hain pehla aaeen kab bana, kabhi Objectives Resolution ki tareekh aur kabhi Senate ki seats ki tadaad. Ye saare sawal seedhe seedhe hain aur in ke number pakke hote hain, bas shart ye hai ke kahani tartib se zehen me bethi ho. Jo student aaeenon ko aik kahani ki tarah samajh le, ke pehle kya hua, phir kya hua aur kyun hua, wo ye sawal kabhi ghalat nahi karega. Is lesson me hum 1947 se shuru karke aaj tak ka poora safar chalte hain."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Pehla setup, 1947"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("14 August 1947 ko Pakistan bana. Naye mulk ke paas apna koi aaeen nahi tha, is liye shuru me Bharat ka 1935 wala Government of India Act hi chalta raha, kuch tabdeeliyon ke sath. Mulk ke pehle Governor General Quaid-e-Azam Muhammad Ali Jinnah bane aur pehle Wazeer-e-Azam Liaquat Ali Khan. Governor General us waqt riyasat ka sarbarah tha, jese aaj ka sadar hota hai, aur wazeer-e-azam hukumat chalata tha."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Is ke sath hi Aaeen Saaz Assembly, yani Constituent Assembly, bhi bani. Is assembly ke do kaam the. Aik, mulk ke liye qanoon banana, yani ye parliament bhi thi. Dusra, Pakistan ka apna aaeen likhna. Quaid-e-Azam is assembly ke pehle sadar muntakhab hue aur 11 August 1947 ko unhon ne is se apna mashhoor khitaab kiya, jisme unhon ne kaha tha ke tamam shehri barabar hain aur mazhab har shakhs ka apna zaati mamla hai. 11 September 1948 ko Quaid-e-Azam ka inteqal ho gaya aur aaeen banane ka kaam abhi shuru hi hua tha. 16 October 1951 ko Liaquat Ali Khan Rawalpindi me aik jalse ke doran shaheed kar diye gaye. Naya mulk apne do sab se bare rehnumaon se mehroom ho chuka tha, aur yahi aik bari wajah hai ke aaeen banne me itni der lagi."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Objectives Resolution, aaeen ki buniyad"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab us dastaveez ki baat jo poore aaeen ki buniyad hai. 7 March 1949 ko Liaquat Ali Khan ne Aaeen Saaz Assembly me Objectives Resolution, yani Qarardad-e-Maqasid, pesh ki aur 12 March 1949 ko ye manzoor ho gayi. Paper me is ki tareekh har dusre saal ati hai, isay pakka yaad kar lo: 12 March 1949."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Is qarardad me kya tha? Khulasa ye hai. Poori kainat par ikhtedar Allah Taala ka hai aur Pakistan ke log us ikhtedar ko Allah ki di hui amanat samajh kar istemal karenge. Mulk jamhoori usoolon par chalega. Musalmanon ko is qabil banaya jayega ke wo apni zindagi Quran aur Sunnat ke mutabiq guzar saken. Bunyadi huqooq ki zamanat hogi. Aqaliton ko apne mazhab par chalne aur apni saqafat barqarar rakhne ki poori azadi hogi. Adliya azad hogi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ye qarardad sirf aik taqreer nahi thi. Baad me banne wale teeno aaeenon ke shuru me ye preamble, yani dibache, ke tor par shamil rahi. Aur 1985 me isay baqaida aaeen ka hissa bana kar Article 2-A bana diya gaya. Isi liye isay Pakistan ke aaeen ki buniyad aur rooh kaha jata hai. Paper me ye sawal bhi ata hai ke Objectives Resolution ko aaeen ka hissa kab banaya gaya, to jawab hai 1985 me, Article 2-A ki surat me."),
      LessonBlock.heading("1956 ka pehla aaeen"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aaeen banne me pure nau saal lag gaye. Wajah ye thi ke bare bare sawalon par ikhtelaf tha. Mulk ka nizam parlimani ho ya sadarti, sobon ko kitni khudmukhtari mile, mashriqi aur maghribi Pakistan ki numaindagi kesay barabar ho, aur Urdu aur Bengali ka mamla kya ho. Aakhir 23 March 1956 ko Pakistan ka pehla aaeen nafiz ho gaya."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Is aaeen ki khaas baatein ye hain. Pakistan ka naam Islamic Republic of Pakistan rakha gaya, yani Islami Jamhuria Pakistan. Nizam parlimani tha, asal ikhtedar wazeer-e-azam aur cabinet ke paas. Parliament aik aiwan par mushtamil thi, sirf National Assembly thi, Senate us waqt nahi bana tha. Mulk wafaqi tha, yani ikhtedar markaz aur sobon me taqseem tha. Iskander Mirza, jo is se pehle aakhri Governor General the, mulk ke pehle Sadar bane, kyunke aaeen ke baad Governor General ka ohda khatam ho gaya aur us ki jagah Sadar ka ohda aa gaya."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("23 March ki tareekh zehen me is liye bhi bitha lo ke ye din do wajah se Pakistan Day hai. Aik, 23 March 1940 ko Lahore me Qarardad-e-Pakistan manzoor hui thi. Dusri, 23 March 1956 ko pehla aaeen nafiz hua. Paper me aksar dono me se koi aik wajah option me de kar phansaya jata hai, asal me dono hi durust hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Lekin ye aaeen sirf dhai saal chala. 7 October 1958 ko Sadar Iskander Mirza ne aaeen mansookh kar diya, assembly tor di aur mulk me pehla martial law laga diya. Unhon ne General Ayub Khan ko Chief Martial Law Administrator banaya. Lekin sirf bees din baad, 27 October 1958 ko, Ayub Khan ne Iskander Mirza ko hata kar unhe mulk se bahar bhej diya aur khud Sadar ban gaye."),
      LessonBlock.heading("1962 ka dusra aaeen"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ayub Khan ne apna aaeen banaya. 1 March 1962 ko is ka elan hua aur 8 June 1962 ko ye nafiz ho gaya. Ye aaeen 1956 wale se bilkul ulta tha. Nizam sadarti tha, yani saara ikhtedar Sadar ke haath me tha aur wazeer-e-azam ka ohda hi khatam kar diya gaya tha. Parliament phir bhi aik aiwan wali thi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Is aaeen ki sab se mashhoor cheez Basic Democracies ka nizam tha. Mulk me Union Council ki satah par assi hazar bunyadi jamhooriyat ke members, jinhe BD members kehte the, muntakhab hue aur yahi assi hazar log sadar ko chunte the. Aik aur baat jo paper me ati hai: is aaeen me pehle mulk ka naam sirf Republic of Pakistan rakha gaya tha, Islam ka lafz hata diya gaya tha. Phir 1963 me pehli aaeeni tarmeem ke zariye naam dobara Islamic Republic of Pakistan kar diya gaya."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("1965 ki jang, mashriqi Pakistan me bechaini aur awaami ehtijaj ke baad Ayub Khan kamzor par gaye. 25 March 1969 ko unhon ne iqtedar General Yahya Khan ke hawale kar diya. Yahya Khan ne dusra martial law lagaya aur 1962 ka aaeen bhi khatam ho gaya. Yun Pakistan ke do aaeen ban kar toot chuke the."),
      LessonBlock.heading("1970 ke intikhabat aur 1971 ki jang"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Yahya Khan ne aik naik aur tareekhi kaam kiya, unhon ne mulk me pehle aam intikhabat karaye. 7 December 1970 ko ye intikhabat hue. Ye Pakistan ki tareekh ke pehle intikhabat the jo aik admi aik vote ki buniyad par hue the. Mashriqi Pakistan se Sheikh Mujibur Rahman ki Awami League ne wazeh aksariyat jeet li aur maghribi Pakistan me Zulfikar Ali Bhutto ki Pakistan Peoples Party sab se bari jamaat ban kar ubhri."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Lekin jeetne wali jamaat ko iqtedar na mila. Baat cheet nakam hui, March 1971 me mashriqi Pakistan me foji operation shuru ho gaya aur khana jangi phoot pari. December 1971 me Bharat ke sath baqaida jang chhir gayi. 16 December 1971 ko Dhaka me Pakistani fauj ne hathyar daal diye. Mashriqi Pakistan alag hokar Bangladesh ban gaya aur nabbe hazar se zyada Pakistani foji aur shehri Bharat ke qaidi ban gaye. Ye Pakistan ki tareekh ka sab se bara sanha tha."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("20 December 1971 ko Yahya Khan ko hatna para aur Zulfikar Ali Bhutto mulk ke Sadar aur Chief Martial Law Administrator bane. July 1972 me Bhutto ne Bharat ki Wazeer-e-Azam Indira Gandhi ke sath Simla Muahida kiya, jis ke tehet jang bandi wali lakeer ko Line of Control, yani LoC, ka naam diya gaya aur qaidiun ki wapsi ki raah hamwar hui. Ab sab se bara kaam aik naya aur mutafiqqa aaeen banana tha."),
      LessonBlock.heading("1973 ka aaeen, sab se aham hissa"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab is lesson ke sab se aham hisse par aao, kyunke one paper ke aaeen wale sawalon me se aadhe se zyada sirf isi aaeen se ate hain. Tamam siyasi jamaaton ke rehnumaon par mushtamil aik aaeen saaz committee ne mahinon ghaur karke masudah tayyar kiya. 10 April 1973 ko National Assembly ne ye aaeen mutafiqqa tor par manzoor kiya aur 14 August 1973 ko ye nafiz ho gaya. Tareekhon ka ye jora pakka yaad kar lo: manzoori 10 April 1973, nifaaz 14 August 1973. Paper me aksar April wali tareekh de kar August wala jawab ghalat karaya jata hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Is aaeen ki khaas baatein aik aik karke samjho."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pehli baat, ye aik likha hua aaeen hai aur Pakistan ka sab se lamba chalne wala aaeen hai. Aaj bhi yehi aaeen nafiz hai, go ke is me kai tarameem ho chuki hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Dusri baat, nizam parlimani hai. Hukumat wazeer-e-azam aur us ki cabinet chalati hai. Sadar riyasat ka sarbarah hai lekin rozmarra ki hukumat us ka kaam nahi. Nifaaz ke waqt Zulfikar Ali Bhutto pehle Wazeer-e-Azam bane aur Fazal Ilahi Chaudhry Sadar bane."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Teesri baat, mulk wafaqi hai. Ikhtedar markaz aur chaar sobon, Punjab, Sindh, Khyber Pakhtunkhwa aur Balochistan, ke darmiyan taqseem hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Chauthi baat, Article 2 ke tehet Islam Pakistan ka riyasati mazhab qarar paya aur mulk ka naam Islamic Republic of Pakistan rakha gaya. Objectives Resolution is aaeen ka preamble bani aur baad me 1985 me Article 2-A ban kar is ka baqaida hissa ban gayi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paanchvi baat, aur ye bohat aham hai, is aaeen ne pehli dafa parliament ko do aiwanon wala banaya. Aiwan-e-Bala ko Senate kehte hain, jisme tamam sobon ko barabar numaindagi milti hai. Aiwan-e-Zeerin ko National Assembly kehte hain, jiske members awaam seedha vote de kar chunte hain. Paper me ye sawal pakka ata hai ke Senate kis aaeen me pehli dafa bana, jawab hai 1973 ke aaeen me."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Chhati baat, Article 251 ke tehet Urdu ko Pakistan ki qaumi zubaan qarar diya gaya. Sath ye bhi likha gaya ke sarkari kaamon me English ka istemal pandrah saal tak jari reh sakta hai, jab tak Urdu us ki jagah na le le."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Saatvi baat, shehriyon ke bunyadi huqooq ki zamanat di gayi aur adliya ko azad rakha gaya. Aathvi baat, sadar aur wazeer-e-azam ke liye musalman hona shart rakha gaya. Aur nawi baat, ye aaeen sakht qism ka hai, is me tarmeem aasan nahi, dono aiwanon ki do tihai aksariyat chahiye hoti hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aik mashhoor tarmeem bhi yaad kar lo. 1974 me dusri aaeeni tarmeem ke zariye Qadiyani jamaat ko aaeen me ghair Muslim aqaliyat qarar diya gaya. Aur 2010 ki atharvi tarmeem bhi bohat mashhoor hai, jis ke tehet sobon ko zyada khudmukhtari mili aur sadar ke bohat se ikhtedarat wazeer-e-azam ko wapas mil gaye."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Tamam Sadar, tartib se"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab Pakistan ke tamam sadar tartib se dekh lo. Naam ke sath un ki muddat bhi di hai, kyunke paper me kabhi tartib poochte hain aur kabhi ye ke falan sadar kab se kab tak raha."),
      LessonBlock.example("Iskander Mirza, 1956 se 1958"),
      LessonBlock.example("Muhammad Ayub Khan, 1958 se 1969"),
      LessonBlock.example("Muhammad Yahya Khan, 1969 se 1971"),
      LessonBlock.example("Zulfikar Ali Bhutto, 1971 se 1973"),
      LessonBlock.example("Fazal Ilahi Chaudhry, 1973 se 1978"),
      LessonBlock.example("Muhammad Zia-ul-Haq, 1978 se 1988"),
      LessonBlock.example("Ghulam Ishaq Khan, 1988 se 1993"),
      LessonBlock.example("Farooq Ahmad Khan Leghari, 1993 se 1997"),
      LessonBlock.example("Muhammad Rafiq Tarar, 1998 se 2001"),
      LessonBlock.example("Pervez Musharraf, 2001 se 2008"),
      LessonBlock.example("Asif Ali Zardari, 2008 se 2013"),
      LessonBlock.example("Mamnoon Hussain, 2013 se 2018"),
      LessonBlock.example("Arif Alvi, 2018 se 2024"),
      LessonBlock.example("Asif Ali Zardari, 2024 se dobara"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Do baatein is list se wazeh kar lo. Asif Ali Zardari Pakistan ke pehle sadar hain jo dusri dafa is ohde par aye. Aur jab kabhi sadar ka ohda khaali hua, Chairman Senate ne qaim maqam sadar ka kaam sambhala, jin me Wasim Sajjad do dafa qaim maqam sadar rahe. Sadar ki muddat paanch saal hoti hai aur unhe parliament aur chaaron sobai assemblies par mushtamil electoral college chunta hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Tamam Wazeer-e-Azam, tartib se"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab wazeer-e-azamon ki tartib dekho. Ye list sadaron ki list se lambi hai, kyunke ibtedai saalon me wazeer-e-azam bohat jaldi jaldi badalte rahe."),
      LessonBlock.example("Liaquat Ali Khan, 1947 se 1951"),
      LessonBlock.example("Khawaja Nazimuddin, 1951 se 1953"),
      LessonBlock.example("Muhammad Ali Bogra, 1953 se 1955"),
      LessonBlock.example("Chaudhry Muhammad Ali, 1955 se 1956"),
      LessonBlock.example("Huseyn Shaheed Suhrawardy, 1956 se 1957"),
      LessonBlock.example("Ibrahim Ismail Chundrigar, 1957, sirf do mah ke qareeb"),
      LessonBlock.example("Malik Feroz Khan Noon, 1957 se 1958"),
      LessonBlock.example("Nurul Amin, December 1971, sirf chand din"),
      LessonBlock.example("Zulfikar Ali Bhutto, 1973 se 1977"),
      LessonBlock.example("Muhammad Khan Junejo, 1985 se 1988"),
      LessonBlock.example("Benazir Bhutto, 1988 se 1990"),
      LessonBlock.example("Nawaz Sharif, 1990 se 1993"),
      LessonBlock.example("Benazir Bhutto, 1993 se 1996, dusri dafa"),
      LessonBlock.example("Nawaz Sharif, 1997 se 1999, dusri dafa"),
      LessonBlock.example("Mir Zafarullah Khan Jamali, 2002 se 2004"),
      LessonBlock.example("Chaudhry Shujaat Hussain, 2004, chand hafte"),
      LessonBlock.example("Shaukat Aziz, 2004 se 2007"),
      LessonBlock.example("Yousaf Raza Gillani, 2008 se 2012"),
      LessonBlock.example("Raja Pervaiz Ashraf, 2012 se 2013"),
      LessonBlock.example("Nawaz Sharif, 2013 se 2017, teesri dafa"),
      LessonBlock.example("Shahid Khaqan Abbasi, 2017 se 2018"),
      LessonBlock.example("Imran Khan, 2018 se 2022"),
      LessonBlock.example("Shehbaz Sharif, 2022 se 2023"),
      LessonBlock.example("Shehbaz Sharif, 2024 se, dusri dafa"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Is list ke khaali hisse bhi samajh lo, kyunke yahi asal kahani hai. 1958 me Ayub Khan ne wazeer-e-azam ka ohda hi khatam kar diya tha, is liye 1958 se 1971 tak koi wazeer-e-azam nahi raha, sirf aakhir me Nurul Amin chand din ke liye bane. 1973 ke aaeen ke baad ye ohda wapas aya aur Bhutto pehle wazeer-e-azam bane. Phir 1977 me Zia-ul-Haq ke martial law ke baad 1985 tak koi wazeer-e-azam nahi raha, Junejo 1985 me bane. Isi tarah 1999 me Musharraf ke ane ke baad 2002 tak ye ohda khaali raha. In khaali muddaton ke darmiyan intikhabat ke waqt chand din ke liye nigrani, yani caretaker, wazeer-e-azam bhi bante rahe hain, jin me Ghulam Mustafa Jatoi, Moeenuddin Ahmad Qureshi, Mir Hazar Khan Khoso, Nasirul Mulk aur Anwaar-ul-Haq Kakar ke naam mashhoor hain. Nawaz Sharif teen dafa wazeer-e-azam banne wale pehle shakhs hain, ye baat bhi paper me ati hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Seats ki tadaad aur umar ki shartein"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aakhir me wo adad o shumar jo paper me sab se zyada ate hain. National Assembly ki kul seats 336 hain. In me 266 aam seats hain jin par awaam seedha vote dete hain, 60 seats khawateen ke liye makhsoos hain aur 10 seats ghair Muslim aqaliton ke liye makhsoos hain. National Assembly ki muddat paanch saal hoti hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Senate ki kul seats 96 hain. Har sobe ko 23 seats milti hain aur Islamabad ko 4 seats. Senator ki muddat chhe saal hoti hai aur har teen saal baad aadhe senator retire ho jate hain, is liye Senate kabhi poori ki poori khatam nahi hoti."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Yahan aik phanda wazeh kar dun. Purani kitabon me tumhe National Assembly ki 342 aur Senate ki 104 seats likhi milengi. Wo purani tadaad hai. FATA ke Khyber Pakhtunkhwa me zam hone ke baad, jo 2018 ki pachisvi aaeeni tarmeem se hua, seats kam ho gayein aur ab durust tadaad National Assembly 336 aur Senate 96 hai. Paper agar nayi kitaab se bana ho to yehi jawab durust hoga."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Umar ki shartein bhi teen numberon me yaad kar lo. Vote dene ka haq har us Pakistani ko hai jis ki umar 18 saal ho jaye. National Assembly ka member banne ke liye kam az kam umar 25 saal hai. Senator banne ke liye kam az kam umar 35 saal hai. Aur Pakistan ka Sadar banne ke liye kam az kam umar 45 saal hai. Teen number zehen me bitha lo: voter 18, MNA 25, senator 35, sadar 45. Bas ye chaar number aaeen wale hisse ke aadhe sawalon ka jawab hain."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Aakhir me dohrana"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Chalo jaldi se poori kahani aik saans me dohra lo. 1949 me Objectives Resolution aaeen ki buniyad bani. 1956 me pehla aaeen aya aur Iskander Mirza pehle sadar bane, lekin 1958 me martial law ne use khatam kar diya. 1962 me Ayub Khan ka sadarti aaeen aya jo 1969 me khatam hua. 1970 me pehle aam intikhabat hue aur 1971 me mulk do tukre ho gaya. Phir 1973 me wo aaeen bana jo aaj tak chal raha hai, parlimani, wafaqi, do aiwanon wala, jisme Islam riyasat ka mazhab aur Urdu qaumi zubaan hai. Is kahani ko is tartib se yaad kar lo, phir koi tareekh idhar udhar nahi hogi."),
    ],
  ),
  GeoTopic(
    id: "symbols-firsts",
    title: "Qaumi Nishanaat, Pehle Pehle, aur Khaas Facts",
    subtitle: "Pakistan ke parcham, tarane aur nishan, tareekh ke pehle pehle, jangain aur qaumi din",
    blocks: <LessonBlock>[
      LessonBlock.heading("Ye file kyun zaroori hai"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("One paper me Pak Studies ke sawalon ka aik bara hissa isi file jaisi baaton se ata hai. Qaumi phool konsa hai, pehla Nobel kis ko mila, pehla Nishan-e-Haider kis ko mila, 23 March kyun manaya jata hai. Ye sawal mushkil nahi hote, bas in ki tadaad bohat hai aur student aksar do milti julti cheezon me ulajh jata hai. Is liye har cheez ko wajah ke sath samjho. Jab wajah yaad ho jati hai to jawab khud yaad rehta hai. Is file ke teen hisse hain: pehle qaumi nishanaat, phir Pakistan ke pehle pehle, aur aakhir me jangain, Nishan-e-Haider aur qaumi din."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Qaumi Parcham"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pakistan ke parcham ko Sabz Hilali Parcham kehte hain. Is ka design Syed Amiruddin Kidwai ne tayyar kiya tha aur 11 August 1947 ko Aaeen Saaz Assembly ne is ki manzoori di. Isi din Liaquat Ali Khan ne ye parcham assembly me pesh kiya tha. Ye tareekh yaad rakho, 11 August 1947, kyunke paper me aksar 14 August de kar phansaya jata hai. Parcham manzoor azadi se teen din pehle hua tha."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab parcham ki shakal ko samjho. Parcham ke chaar hisse hain. Teen hisse sabz rang ke hain aur aik hissa, yani aik chauthai, safed patti ki surat me dande wali taraf hai. Sabz hisse ke darmiyan safed hilal, yani chaand, aur paanch nokon wala sitara bana hai. Parcham ki lambai aur chorai ka tanasub teen aur do ka hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Har rang aur nishan ka matlab hai. Sabz rang mulk ki Muslim aksariyat, taraqqi aur khushhali ki alamat hai. Safed patti ghair Muslim aqaliton ki alamat hai aur aman ka pegham hai, ke Pakistan me rehne wali aqaliton ko barabar ke huqooq hasil hain. Hilal taraqqi ki alamat hai, ke mulk aage barhta rahega. Sitara roshni aur ilm ki alamat hai. Paper me aksar poochte hain ke safed rang kis ki alamat hai, jawab hai aqaliton ki."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Qaumi Tarana"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Qaumi tarane ke alfaaz Abu Al-Asar Hafeez Jalandhari ne likhe the aur is ki dhun Ahmed Ghulam Ali Chagla ne banayi thi. Dhun pehle bani, 1949 me, aur alfaaz baad me muntakhab hue. 1954 me qaumi tarana baqaida tor par ikhtiyar kiya gaya. Tarana Pak sarzamin shad bad se shuru hota hai aur is ke teen band hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aik dilchasp baat jo kitabon me bohat ati hai. Tarane ke alfaaz zyada tar Farsi zubaan ke hain aur kaha jata hai ke pure tarane me Urdu ka sirf aik lafz istemal hua hai, aur wo hai \"ka\". Ye baat is liye mashhoor hai ke tarane ki zubaan ko Urdu aur Farsi dono ka sangam dikhana maqsood tha. Naam aur kaam dono yaad rakho: alfaaz Hafeez Jalandhari, dhun Ahmed Chagla. Paper me aksar dono ko ulta de kar phansaya jata hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Qaumi Nishan, yani State Emblem"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pakistan ka qaumi nishan, jisay angrezi me state emblem kehte hain, 1954 me ikhtiyar kiya gaya. Is ki shakal gaur se dekho to har cheez ka matlab samajh ata hai. Sab se upar hilal aur sitara hai, jo parcham ki tarah mulk ki pehchan hai. Darmiyan me aik dhaal hai jis par Pakistan ki chaar aham faslain bani hain: kapas, gandum, chai aur patsan, yani jute. Ye chaar faslain us waqt ki Pakistani maeeshat ki buniyad thin. Dhaal ke dono taraf chambeli ke phoolon ka haar hai. Aur sab se neeche aik patti par Quaid-e-Azam ka mashhoor farmaan likha hai: Iman, Ittehad, Tanzeem. Yani faith, unity aur discipline. Paper me ye sawal ata hai ke qaumi nishan par konsi faslain hain aur neeche kya likha hai, dono ka jawab ab tumhe ata hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Baqi qaumi nishanaat"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab baqi nishanaat aik aik karke, wajah ke sath."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pakistan ka qaumi janwar Markhor hai. Ye aik jangli pahari bakra hai jo mulk ke shimali aur maghribi pahari ilaqon me paya jata hai. Is ke bal khaye hue bare seengh is ki pehchan hain. Markhor Farsi zubaan ka lafz hai jis ka matlab hai sanp khane wala, aur is janwar ke bare me yehi riwayat mashhoor hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Qaumi parinda Chakor hai. Ye bhi pahari ilaqon ka parinda hai aur Pakistan ki sarzameen se is ka purana talluq hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Qaumi phool Chambeli hai, jisay angrezi me jasmine kehte hain. Safed rang aur mithi khushboo wala ye phool qaumi nishan ke haar me bhi shamil hai, is liye emblem wale sawal se isay jor kar yaad rakho."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Qaumi darakht Deodar hai. Ye unche pahari ilaqon me ugne wala lamba aur mazboot darakht hai, jis ki lakri imaraton me bohat kaam ati hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Qaumi khel Hockey hai. Nayi nasal ko ye jaan kar hairat hoti hai, lekin Pakistan hockey me duniya ki sab se kamyab teamon me raha hai. Pakistan ne hockey ke chaar World Cup jeete, 1971, 1978, 1982 aur 1994 me, aur teen dafa Olympic gold medal bhi jeeta, 1960, 1968 aur 1984 me. Isi liye hockey ko qaumi khel ka darja mila."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Qaumi zubaan Urdu hai, jaisa ke 1973 ke aaeen ke Article 251 me likha hai. Qaumi mazhab Islam hai, jo Article 2 ke tehet riyasat ka mazhab hai. Qaumi rehnuma Quaid-e-Azam Muhammad Ali Jinnah hain, jinhe Bani-e-Pakistan kaha jata hai. Qaumi shair Allama Muhammad Iqbal hain, jinhe Musawwir-e-Pakistan bhi kehte hain, kyunke 1930 ke Allahabad khutbe me unhon ne alag Muslim riyasat ka tasavvur pesh kiya tha."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Qaumi airline PIA hai, yani Pakistan International Airlines, jo 1955 me qayam hui. Is se pehle 1946 me Orient Airways bani thi, jo baad me PIA me zam ho gayi. Mulk ka markazi bank State Bank of Pakistan hai, jis ka iftatah 1 July 1948 ko Quaid-e-Azam ne khud kiya tha aur is ke pehle Governor Zahid Hussain the. Qaumi libaas Shalwar Qameez hai, qaumi phal Aam hai aur qaumi mashroob ganne ka ras mashhoor hai. Ye chand aakhir wali baatein kitabon me aam taur par isi tartib se milti hain."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Pakistan ke pehle pehle"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab tareekh ke pehle pehle dekh lo. Ye sawal one paper ke sab se zyada dohraye jane wale sawal hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pakistan ke pehle Governor General Quaid-e-Azam Muhammad Ali Jinnah the. Unhon ne 14 August 1947 ko ohda sambhala aur 11 September 1948 ko wafat tak is par rahe. Un ke baad Khawaja Nazimuddin dusre Governor General bane."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pakistan ke pehle Sadar Iskander Mirza the. Governor General ka ohda 1956 ke aaeen ke sath khatam hua aur 23 March 1956 ko Iskander Mirza pehle sadar bane. Ye farq yaad rakho: Jinnah pehle Governor General the, Mirza pehle Sadar. Paper yahi farq phansata hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pakistan ke pehle Wazeer-e-Azam Liaquat Ali Khan the. Wo Quaid ke sab se qareebi saathi the aur unhe Shaheed-e-Millat ka khitab mila. 16 October 1951 ko Rawalpindi ke Company Bagh me unhe shaheed kar diya gaya. Us bagh ka naam baad me Liaquat Bagh rakh diya gaya."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Duniya bhar me mashhoor pehli baat ye hai ke Pakistan ki pehli aurat wazeer-e-azam Benazir Bhutto thin. Wo 1988 me wazeer-e-azam banein aur wo poori Muslim duniya ki pehli aurat wazeer-e-azam thin. Wo do dafa is ohde par rahein."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pakistan ke pehle Chief Justice Justice Abdul Rashid the. Wo 1949 me mulk ki sab se barri adalat ke pehle sarbarah bane, jab adalat ko Federal Court kaha jata tha."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pakistan ko pehla Nobel inaam Dr Abdus Salam ko mila. Unhon ne 1979 me tabiyaat, yani physics, ka Nobel inaam jeeta. Wo Pakistan ke pehle aur science me ab tak ke wahid Nobel yafta hain. Dusra Nobel inaam Malala Yousafzai ko 2014 me aman ka mila. Malala ki khaas baat ye hai ke wo Nobel inaam pane wali duniya ki sab se kam umar shakhsiyat hain, inaam ke waqt un ki umar sirf satrah saal thi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pakistan ka pehla Nishan-e-Haider Captain Muhammad Sarwar ko mila. Wo 1948 ki Kashmir ki jang me shaheed hue the. Nishan-e-Haider Pakistan ka sab se bara foji aizaz hai, is ki tafseel isi file me aage ati hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pakistan ka pehla satellite Badr-1 tha, jo 16 July 1990 ko China se khala me bheja gaya. Pakistan ka khalai idara SUPARCO is se bohat pehle, 1961 me, ban chuka tha. Ye do tareekhein jor kar yaad rakho: idara 1961, pehla satellite 1990."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Jangain, mukhtasar"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab un jangon ka mukhtasar jayeza jo Pakistan ne lari hain. Har jang ki wajah aur natija aik saans me samajh lo."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pehli jang 1947 aur 1948 me Kashmir par hui. Taqseem ke waqt Kashmir ki taqseem par tanaza khara ho gaya tha. Qabaili lashkar aur Kashmiri mujahideen ki ladai ke baad Bharat ye mamla Aqwaam-e-Muttahida le gaya. 1 January 1949 ko jang bandi ho gayi aur jahan faujain rukin, wahan ceasefire line ban gayi. Yehi lakeer baad me 1972 ke Simla Muahide ke baad Line of Control, yani LoC, kahlai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Dusri jang 1965 me hui. 6 September 1965 ki subah Bharat ne Lahore ki janib achanak hamla kar diya. Jang satrah roz jari rahi. Is jang me poori qaum fauj ke sath khari ho gayi, is liye 6 September ko har saal Youm-e-Difa, yani Defence Day, manaya jata hai. Aakhir 10 January 1966 ko Ayub Khan aur Bharat ke Wazeer-e-Azam Lal Bahadur Shastri ke darmiyan Tashkent Muahida hua aur jang ka baqaida khatma hua."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Teesri jang 1971 me hui, jis ka zikr aaeen wale lesson me bhi aya hai. Is ke natije me 16 December 1971 ko Dhaka ka suqoot hua aur mashriqi Pakistan Bangladesh ban gaya. Ye jang Pakistan ki tareekh ka sab se talkh waqia hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Chauthi barri jhadap Kargil ki jang hai jo 1999 me hui. Kargil ki unchi barfeeli chotiyon par May se July 1999 tak ladai hoti rahi. Isay duniya ki sab se unchi jagah par lari jane wali jangon me gina jata hai. July 1999 me ye ladai khatam hui. Isi jang ke do sipahiyon ko Nishan-e-Haider mila, Captain Karnal Sher Khan aur Havildar Lalak Jan ko."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Nishan-e-Haider pane wale"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Nishan-e-Haider Pakistan ka sab se bara foji aizaz hai. Is ke bare me teen baatein pehle yaad kar lo. Aik, ye ab tak sirf gyarah fojion ko mila hai. Dusri, ye tamam ke tamam shaheedon ko un ki shahadat ke baad mila, koi aik bhi zinda shakhs ko nahi mila. Teesri, in gyarah me se das ka talluq Pakistan Army se hai aur aik ka, Pilot Officer Rashid Minhas ka, Pakistan Air Force se. Ab tartib se naam dekho."),
      LessonBlock.example("Captain Muhammad Sarwar, 1948, Kashmir ki jang"),
      LessonBlock.example("Naik Saif Ali Janjua, 1948, Kashmir ki jang. Inhe pehle Hilal-e-Kashmir mila tha jo baad me Nishan-e-Haider ke barabar qarar diya gaya"),
      LessonBlock.example("Major Tufail Muhammad, 1958, mashriqi Pakistan ki sarhad par"),
      LessonBlock.example("Major Raja Aziz Bhatti, 1965, Lahore ke qareeb Burki ka muhaz"),
      LessonBlock.example("Major Muhammad Akram, 1971, mashriqi Pakistan ka muhaz"),
      LessonBlock.example("Pilot Officer Rashid Minhas, 1971, Pakistan Air Force ke wahid Nishan-e-Haider"),
      LessonBlock.example("Major Shabbir Sharif, 1971, Sulemanki ka muhaz"),
      LessonBlock.example("Sowar Muhammad Hussain, 1971, Zafarwal Shakargarh ka muhaz"),
      LessonBlock.example("Lance Naik Muhammad Mahfuz, 1971, Wagah Attari ka muhaz"),
      LessonBlock.example("Captain Karnal Sher Khan, 1999, Kargil"),
      LessonBlock.example("Havildar Lalak Jan, 1999, Kargil"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("In naamon ko jangon ke sath jor kar yaad karo. 1948 wale do, 1965 wala aik, 1971 wale paanch, Kargil wale do, aur darmiyan me 1958 ka aik. Yun gyarah ka hisaab bhi yaad rahega aur tartib bhi."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Qaumi din"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aakhir me wo din jo har saal manaye jate hain. Har din ke sath us ki wajah di hai, kyunke paper me din nahi, wajah phansati hai."),
      LessonBlock.example("5 February, Youm-e-Yakjehti-e-Kashmir. Kashmiri awam ke sath yakjehti ke izhar ka din."),
      LessonBlock.example("23 March, Pakistan Day, yani Youm-e-Pakistan. Is din ki do wajah hain. 23 March 1940 ko Lahore ke Minto Park me Qarardad-e-Pakistan manzoor hui thi aur 23 March 1956 ko Pakistan ka pehla aaeen nafiz hua tha."),
      LessonBlock.example("1 May, Youm-e-Mazdoor. Mazdooron ka aalmi din, Labour Day."),
      LessonBlock.example("14 August, Youm-e-Azadi. 1947 me isi din Pakistan bana tha."),
      LessonBlock.example("6 September, Youm-e-Difa. 1965 ki jang ki yaad me Defence Day manaya jata hai."),
      LessonBlock.example("9 November, Iqbal Day. Allama Muhammad Iqbal 9 November 1877 ko Sialkot me paida hue the."),
      LessonBlock.example("25 December, Quaid-e-Azam Day. Quaid-e-Azam 25 December 1876 ko Karachi me paida hue the."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Do paidaish wale din jor kar yaad kar lo: Iqbal 9 November ko aur Quaid 25 December ko. Aur do tareekhi din bhi jor kar rakho: azadi 14 August ko aur difa 6 September ko. Aik aakhri baat dohra lo. Is file ke sab se zyada dohraye jane wale sawal ye hain: parcham ka designer Amiruddin Kidwai, tarane ke alfaaz Hafeez Jalandhari aur dhun Ahmed Chagla, pehle sadar Iskander Mirza, pehle Nobel Dr Abdus Salam, pehla Nishan-e-Haider Captain Sarwar, aur Nishan-e-Haider ki kul tadaad gyarah. Ye chhe baatein pakki kar lo to is file ke aadhe sawal wahin khatam ho jate hain."),
    ],
  ),
];
